1
00:01:59,575 --> 00:02:07,555
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:09,726 --> 00:02:11,044
Alps.

3
00:02:17,126 --> 00:02:18,485
Brother.

4
00:03:08,566 --> 00:03:14,565
Allah is the greatest!

5
00:03:31,526 --> 00:03:37,765
Alps! Strike your swords, for union!

6
00:03:37,846 --> 00:03:43,405
For being hope to the oppressed!
Allah is the greatest!

7
00:03:46,646 --> 00:03:50,405
You will vomit blood, find death!

8
00:03:50,486 --> 00:03:55,325
Strip their flesh

9
00:04:30,086 --> 00:04:33,445
Alaeddin!

10
00:05:06,726 --> 00:05:13,405
Alps have become martyr. May tyrants meet hell.

11
00:05:13,646 --> 00:05:17,365
My Allah, help me.

12
00:05:17,446 --> 00:05:21,245
Come on Alps, come on.

13
00:06:02,566 --> 00:06:06,645
Ya Allah!

14
00:06:18,926 --> 00:06:22,885
The lust of death bringing
spirits is on our swords!

15
00:06:22,966 --> 00:06:25,565
All of you will taste this curse!

16
00:06:26,046 --> 00:06:28,365
Commander, some of them are catching up.

17
00:06:28,366 --> 00:06:32,005
They will only find death when they arrive.

18
00:06:32,086 --> 00:06:39,525
My soldiers, we've done what
we could. Now we fall back!

19
00:07:01,526 --> 00:07:06,765
Come on, come on.

20
00:07:10,046 --> 00:07:12,973
Why are mongols falling back?

21
00:07:12,985 --> 00:07:15,165
I do not know master.

22
00:07:49,486 --> 00:07:53,605
-Boran, check the wounded.
-Okay my bey.

23
00:07:54,646 --> 00:07:57,485
My bey, my bey.

24
00:07:57,606 --> 00:08:01,365
Orhan. Orhan.

25
00:08:02,646 --> 00:08:07,245
Are you alright? Come on, get up.

26
00:08:07,326 --> 00:08:10,725
-Come on, get up.
-Son.

27
00:08:11,166 --> 00:08:12,525
-Kanyumaz.
-My Sultan.

28
00:08:12,606 --> 00:08:17,645
Help me, take him.
Get up my son.

29
00:08:19,006 --> 00:08:24,245
-We lost a lot, my bey.
-Alps, alps..

30
00:08:27,486 --> 00:08:34,365
Alaeddin! Alps, bring water!

31
00:08:36,446 --> 00:08:42,365
Come, come. Give me this water.

32
00:08:52,086 --> 00:08:58,605
What is this. What is this..

33
00:08:59,046 --> 00:09:02,725
You will be alright.
You will be alright.

34
00:09:10,366 --> 00:09:13,245
Mehmed. My son.

35
00:09:13,646 --> 00:09:15,125
-Mehmed?
-Father.

36
00:09:15,206 --> 00:09:16,685
-Mehmed.
-Father.

37
00:09:16,766 --> 00:09:20,605
-Are you alright, my son?
-Father.

38
00:09:32,846 --> 00:09:39,645
-Brother.
-My brother, you are alright.

39
00:09:50,486 --> 00:09:55,125
Gurbuz.

40
00:09:59,046 --> 00:10:01,405
Alps.

41
00:10:03,526 --> 00:10:07,045
"Indeed, to Allah we belong
and to Allah we shall return."

42
00:10:07,246 --> 00:10:11,845
-What happened, my son?
-They've come unexpected.

43
00:10:12,246 --> 00:10:16,885
They stroke us, then retreated into the woods.

44
00:10:17,646 --> 00:10:21,005
What are you standing for? After them!

45
00:10:21,086 --> 00:10:24,045
Yakup Bey.

46
00:10:30,286 --> 00:10:37,285
Yakup Bey! They blatantly
ambushed, they must've thought after.

47
00:10:37,406 --> 00:10:42,805
Think about that and act accordingly.
The blood of alps is on your hands.

48
00:10:43,006 --> 00:10:47,205
Pull yourself together, Osman Bey.

49
00:10:48,446 --> 00:10:51,445
Germiyanoglu Border - Frontier Market

50
00:10:54,726 --> 00:10:58,165
Am I allowed, Malhun Hatun?

51
00:10:58,326 --> 00:11:01,885
I've said what I've said, my daughter.

52
00:11:02,006 --> 00:11:06,845
I know, however please listen to me.

53
00:11:07,846 --> 00:11:11,045
Do not disappoint me, Aysima.

54
00:11:12,126 --> 00:11:16,885
You lied about Holofira.
There is no explanation.

55
00:11:17,846 --> 00:11:22,085
Malhun Hatun. When someone..

56
00:11:22,966 --> 00:11:26,405
Falls in love..

57
00:11:26,606 --> 00:11:31,565
They do things that they
never thought of doing.

58
00:11:37,526 --> 00:11:43,325
If you never came to me, I wouldn't even
dreamed about being a hatun for Orhan Bey.

59
00:11:45,246 --> 00:11:50,725
However, you've been such a mother
to me, you've given me such hope..

60
00:11:55,846 --> 00:11:59,685
I got scared that Holofira will destroy this.

61
00:12:03,846 --> 00:12:06,925
You are right, my daughter.

62
00:12:07,126 --> 00:12:12,605
However, you did not let Holofira
destroy it. You did it all by yourself.

63
00:12:12,846 --> 00:12:16,325
There is no excuse for
what I've done. I know that.

64
00:12:16,406 --> 00:12:21,565
However, please forgive me.
Or I will never forgive myself.

65
00:12:25,926 --> 00:12:30,965
You have to apologize to Holofira before me.

66
00:12:32,766 --> 00:12:39,165
I am not the one to decide what
happens next, Orhan Bey will decide.

67
00:12:50,086 --> 00:12:55,725
How will you pay for what you've done?

68
00:12:55,886 --> 00:12:59,885
Don't talk like you've never got
ambushed before, Osman Bey.

69
00:13:00,206 --> 00:13:03,605
We know your past as well.

70
00:13:03,686 --> 00:13:08,005
We've never experienced such a disaster before.

71
00:13:08,206 --> 00:13:12,605
What are you saying, Yakup
Bey? You will pay for all of this here.

72
00:13:12,646 --> 00:13:16,645
You will take care of the families
of these alps for the rest of your life.

73
00:13:16,766 --> 00:13:20,805
Who are you to command me?

74
00:13:20,926 --> 00:13:22,805
-Know your place.
-Who are you?

75
00:13:22,966 --> 00:13:26,405
Osman Bey, we have martyrs.

76
00:13:26,806 --> 00:13:30,685
Don't do this, for
them at least.

77
00:13:35,566 --> 00:13:41,405
Tell me. Who gave you this idea?

78
00:13:41,726 --> 00:13:45,725
Who?

79
00:13:45,806 --> 00:13:50,885
Who told you to strike during the trade? Who?

80
00:14:00,046 --> 00:14:03,325
It is my fault.

81
00:14:11,806 --> 00:14:15,565
With my merchant mind I couldn't have known.

82
00:14:15,766 --> 00:14:20,805
Vasilis or Veysel, whatever he
is called. He is quite important..

83
00:14:20,966 --> 00:14:23,685
Quite valuable to the crusaders.

84
00:14:23,766 --> 00:14:27,885
I heard that, and I told my
Yakup Bey. I shouldn't have.

85
00:14:28,086 --> 00:14:31,365
My Sultan has decided a trade. However..

86
00:14:31,486 --> 00:14:36,245
They wanted to strike them while
trading, that is fit for my Sultan.

87
00:14:36,366 --> 00:14:39,845
With this infidel, trade is only possible..

88
00:14:39,966 --> 00:14:46,085
With sword anyways. He did what
fit him. However, it didn't go well.

89
00:14:46,166 --> 00:14:50,445
My Osman Bey. I know there
are a lot of traitors among us.

90
00:14:50,446 --> 00:14:53,285
However, may Allah be my
judge, I am not a traitor. If I am..

91
00:14:53,286 --> 00:14:56,725
May Allah not allow me to leave these woods.

92
00:14:56,806 --> 00:15:02,485
If there is one to blame, that is me.

93
00:15:05,606 --> 00:15:08,605
If there is a head to take

94
00:15:11,086 --> 00:15:12,725
...it's mine.

95
00:15:31,646 --> 00:15:35,485
I assume full responsibility, Osman Bey.

96
00:15:39,686 --> 00:15:42,725
Ayhan Agha...

97
00:15:46,286 --> 00:15:49,485
Ayhan Agha.

98
00:15:51,486 --> 00:15:58,205
I thought you were a skillful
merchant who loves his nation.

99
00:16:01,766 --> 00:16:03,285
I am..

100
00:16:21,606 --> 00:16:24,285
Thank you, my Bey.

101
00:16:26,126 --> 00:16:28,805
I owe you two lives.

102
00:16:30,086 --> 00:16:35,645
Don't worry. Nobody will remain indebted to me.

103
00:16:40,886 --> 00:16:49,005
It's your turn, beys. You should know
this. Neither loyalty nor sultanate matters!

104
00:16:50,366 --> 00:16:56,125
There is only fight! I'm going to fight now.

105
00:16:56,806 --> 00:16:58,765
Anyone can join me.

106
00:16:58,806 --> 00:17:05,805
Even if you don't join me
and if the enemy show mercy,

107
00:17:07,486 --> 00:17:10,165
...I will take no offense, anyway.

108
00:17:15,406 --> 00:17:18,045
Alps.

109
00:17:19,646 --> 00:17:22,765
Take the martyrs and the wounded.

110
00:17:34,686 --> 00:17:41,085
We, as beys, will discuss the matter.

111
00:17:41,606 --> 00:17:45,925
Things are happening too fast, Yakup Bey.

112
00:17:49,126 --> 00:17:54,365
May your journey be safe and your minds sharp.

113
00:17:57,046 --> 00:18:01,845
Don't be agitated.
Think thoroughly.

114
00:18:02,246 --> 00:18:05,685
Go ahead. Stay safe.

115
00:18:19,726 --> 00:18:22,925
Where are you going, Ayhan Agha?

116
00:18:37,166 --> 00:18:44,645
Alps, we had been suspecting.
And our suspicion turned to be true.

117
00:18:47,366 --> 00:18:52,085
-Bayindir Bey. Sons.
-My Bey.

118
00:18:52,726 --> 00:18:56,845
You will go after Ayhan Agha.

119
00:18:58,806 --> 00:19:03,685
My Bey, will we go after him
only because of this incident?

120
00:19:03,926 --> 00:19:09,085
He caused many warriors to die!
What more can he even do, Boran Bey?

121
00:19:12,366 --> 00:19:16,085
Bayindir Bey, speak.

122
00:19:16,166 --> 00:19:22,205
When I followed Ayhan that day,
he led me where he kept the gold.

123
00:19:22,526 --> 00:19:25,365
He looked worried about his gold.

124
00:19:25,966 --> 00:19:33,045
But I know that fear well, my Bey.
There was something up. Something tricky.

125
00:19:35,366 --> 00:19:39,645
That's why he used to
get lost in the battlefield.

126
00:19:40,526 --> 00:19:44,965
My Bey, do you think Ayhan set up this game?

127
00:19:45,206 --> 00:19:49,485
Let’s not hurry to judge, brother.
We all heard. He's a tradesman.

128
00:19:49,606 --> 00:19:54,965
He's afraid of war. He was looking for a
place to hide when our Bey saved him.

129
00:19:55,926 --> 00:20:02,365
Sons, there may be a coincidence.

130
00:20:04,006 --> 00:20:08,165
If justice is broken once,

131
00:20:08,406 --> 00:20:12,885
...both the state and the
nation won't get better anymore.

132
00:20:13,126 --> 00:20:19,885
For this reason, we'll be sure first.
Then the heads will fall on the ground.

133
00:20:21,046 --> 00:20:26,205
Nobody will act without
orders before we are sure.

134
00:20:27,446 --> 00:20:31,005
-Okay, my Bey.
-Bayindir Bey.

135
00:20:32,326 --> 00:20:35,245
Sons. Get back to your duties now.

136
00:20:35,406 --> 00:20:40,045
We'll spread around and
learn everything about Ayhan.

137
00:20:40,086 --> 00:20:42,605
Let's go!

138
00:20:51,086 --> 00:20:58,525
Osman spared your life but I
haven't interrogated you yet.

139
00:21:06,766 --> 00:21:09,805
My Sultan.

140
00:21:10,886 --> 00:21:14,485
The battle has just begun. I am exhausted.

141
00:21:14,726 --> 00:21:17,845
We should go and cure our wounds.

142
00:21:17,926 --> 00:21:20,685
May your merchandise be cursed!

143
00:21:21,246 --> 00:21:25,365
You smell the gold from a hundred miles away.

144
00:21:25,646 --> 00:21:30,725
But you don't realize you are
being drawn into a trap, huh?

145
00:21:31,086 --> 00:21:36,125
Or you realized.

146
00:21:37,006 --> 00:21:42,645
And they paid you well in return
for drawing us into the trap, ha?

147
00:21:42,766 --> 00:21:47,245
Oh, my Sultan... No way.

148
00:21:48,526 --> 00:21:54,045
Would I betray my nation
while we have so many martyrs?

149
00:21:56,286 --> 00:22:01,245
Look. I'm not like Osman.
I would break your neck.

150
00:22:01,526 --> 00:22:06,725
You let that dog run off. My alps
got slaughtered because of you.

151
00:22:07,006 --> 00:22:12,405
Leave him, Mehmed. Let him speak.

152
00:22:19,646 --> 00:22:22,405
Mehmed Bey.

153
00:22:23,846 --> 00:22:30,325
My Sultan, I'm only
good at trade. That's right.

154
00:22:30,566 --> 00:22:36,325
But it doesn't mean I'm a treacherous man.

155
00:22:36,606 --> 00:22:40,485
I don't need to get rich with treachery at all.

156
00:22:40,566 --> 00:22:43,845
Thanks to Allah, I've earned enough so far.

157
00:22:44,006 --> 00:22:49,045
May Allah be my witness. I said
just some words and look at this.

158
00:22:49,326 --> 00:22:53,245
-I'd gladly lose money instead of my life!
-Ayhan Agha.

159
00:22:56,446 --> 00:23:02,365
Go away. And stay out of my sight for a while.

160
00:23:02,686 --> 00:23:05,325
Go!

161
00:23:07,966 --> 00:23:13,725
As Mighty Sultan orders.
I will be away...

162
00:23:13,926 --> 00:23:16,885
...until I deserve your forgiveness.

163
00:23:20,606 --> 00:23:23,125
Mehmed Bey.

164
00:23:29,566 --> 00:23:33,565
I'm already invisible, fools.

165
00:23:34,006 --> 00:23:36,565
-Kanyumaz.
-My Sultan.

166
00:23:37,486 --> 00:23:41,685
Send a man after him I want
to know every move of his.

167
00:23:42,006 --> 00:23:45,085
As you order, my Sultan.

168
00:23:45,406 --> 00:23:47,885
What are your orders for us, my Bey?

169
00:23:49,366 --> 00:23:53,125
A Bey wouldn't order anything but fight.

170
00:23:54,406 --> 00:23:59,285
For the blood of Gurbuz and the other martyrs,

171
00:24:00,246 --> 00:24:01,965
...we will fight.

172
00:24:04,566 --> 00:24:08,565
Now, give the swords we took
from the caravan to our people.

173
00:24:08,886 --> 00:24:11,965
Take the rest to the Beys.

174
00:24:12,046 --> 00:24:14,285
Yes my Bey.

175
00:24:14,966 --> 00:24:18,805
The Alps will take courage
after they see the swords.

176
00:24:19,886 --> 00:24:24,965
My Bey. You never give swords
before showing us the target.

177
00:24:25,366 --> 00:24:28,610
Tell us, where will we walk?

178
00:24:28,622 --> 00:24:31,205
We will walk to Kite.

179
00:24:33,766 --> 00:24:38,605
Prepare the army and the
things we need for a siege.

180
00:24:38,686 --> 00:24:41,205
Yes my Bey.

181
00:24:42,406 --> 00:24:46,845
The swords will make Alps happy,
and the news of a gaza (Islamic war)..

182
00:24:47,166 --> 00:24:50,525
...will make everyone gather behind us.

183
00:24:50,846 --> 00:24:55,485
Mongols were going to think we
were scared after the last incident.

184
00:24:55,686 --> 00:25:00,285
They will see that they were
wrong after our conquest.

185
00:25:00,606 --> 00:25:03,965
We will show them that we are not scared now...

186
00:25:04,246 --> 00:25:07,485
...not before the conquest.

187
00:25:10,326 --> 00:25:14,765
My Bey... The archers positioned
themselves within ambush range.

188
00:25:16,446 --> 00:25:22,205
Our children are after the traitor
our Hodjas are after the cruel.

189
00:25:24,526 --> 00:25:29,005
Cerkutay! Like old times, huh?

190
00:25:29,646 --> 00:25:33,725
Okay my Bey. The revenge of Alps...

191
00:25:33,886 --> 00:25:37,205
...and Gurbuz brother
will be taken if Allah permits.

192
00:25:37,446 --> 00:25:40,805
-For sure!
-My Bey...

193
00:25:41,326 --> 00:25:46,165
Shooting the Governor of
Konya is shooting Olcaytu.

194
00:25:47,366 --> 00:25:52,165
We are not afraid. But it will cost us a lot.

195
00:25:55,886 --> 00:26:01,365
We have to shoot that dog
before we arrive in Konya.

196
00:26:03,886 --> 00:26:09,685
Or else, or else... We
will be in great trouble.

197
00:26:12,366 --> 00:26:18,205
Alps! Today, the end of the cruel will come.

198
00:26:20,886 --> 00:26:21,805
Come on!

199
00:26:33,966 --> 00:26:37,925
We killed his Alps. His
Shahzades were going to die.

200
00:26:38,086 --> 00:26:44,485
We had enough power to
kill them all. We were so close.

201
00:26:46,486 --> 00:26:49,605
Send news to Osman Bey.

202
00:26:50,846 --> 00:26:56,125
Those who cannot rule power
are crushed under that power.

203
00:26:56,406 --> 00:27:01,645
Those who know when to put their
swords back in their sheathes always win.

204
00:27:02,046 --> 00:27:05,925
Osman and Yakup saw our strength.

205
00:27:06,086 --> 00:27:11,645
Soon, they will lose their heads, huh?

206
00:27:19,046 --> 00:27:22,925
We will go right away and unite with Horsemen.

207
00:27:23,166 --> 00:27:30,605
If one's horse dies, he will go on foot, if
one's courage dies, he will lose his life.

208
00:27:34,126 --> 00:27:37,125
Germiyanoglu Border - Frontier Market

209
00:27:40,326 --> 00:27:43,523
Are you feeling better,
my beautiful daughter?

210
00:27:43,535 --> 00:27:44,605
Thank you.

211
00:27:44,726 --> 00:27:47,325
Sure, I am alright.

212
00:27:47,846 --> 00:27:50,805
There is nothing to feel sorry for.

213
00:27:51,126 --> 00:27:55,525
Those who are right always stand tall.

214
00:27:55,726 --> 00:27:59,325
That's what I expected from you.

215
00:28:00,086 --> 00:28:03,885
And people who blamed
you before listening to you..

216
00:28:04,006 --> 00:28:09,765
...saw your nobleness in the marketplace.

217
00:28:17,766 --> 00:28:20,765
Holofira..

218
00:28:21,006 --> 00:28:22,304
-Are you busy?

219
00:28:22,316 --> 00:28:26,245
I am not going to listen to
you while you insult me, Aysima.

220
00:28:28,246 --> 00:28:33,005
Leave my counter, or else...

221
00:28:36,486 --> 00:28:40,445
You are right about everything. I
came here to ask for forgiveness.

222
00:28:42,086 --> 00:28:45,565
Forgiveness?

223
00:28:46,606 --> 00:28:51,085
Everyone was talking
about us in the marketplace.

224
00:28:51,206 --> 00:28:56,685
They said "Holofira took your fiance
from you, and you are just watching them."

225
00:28:58,086 --> 00:29:04,165
When I heard it, I lost my mind.

226
00:29:07,006 --> 00:29:12,605
But I know that you are not guilty. Besides,
you were not the one who promised me.

227
00:29:19,846 --> 00:29:25,045
I did wrong. Forgive me.

228
00:29:25,806 --> 00:29:28,525
Good.

229
00:29:29,126 --> 00:29:33,005
Still, do not come across me again.

230
00:29:48,606 --> 00:29:51,565
Aysima seems genuine, but...

231
00:29:51,686 --> 00:29:55,725
...still, I cannot be
relieved before I test her.

232
00:29:55,846 --> 00:29:59,645
Asking for forgiveness requires bravery.

233
00:29:59,806 --> 00:30:02,460
She made us suspicious
for once. It would be

234
00:30:02,472 --> 00:30:05,485
beneficial to investigate
thoroughly, you are right.

235
00:30:05,566 --> 00:30:12,125
Let's see. If Holofira accepts being a
Muslim, then everything will change.

236
00:30:15,646 --> 00:30:19,805
Each age of children is a different test.

237
00:30:20,086 --> 00:30:23,765
I hope we can help them get married happily.

238
00:30:23,926 --> 00:30:27,325
Aameen Bala. Aameen.

239
00:30:29,646 --> 00:30:33,485
Did you do something about
Gonca? Did something new happen?

240
00:30:33,726 --> 00:30:38,285
Sure. Sure. Alaeddin told Gonca he loved her.

241
00:30:38,406 --> 00:30:43,285
I think Gonca loves him too.

242
00:30:43,366 --> 00:30:47,445
-May it be blessed.
-May it be blessed.

243
00:30:51,086 --> 00:30:55,205
Being co-in-laws with Yakup
Bey is going to be hard, I know.

244
00:30:55,526 --> 00:31:01,605
But... Gonca is a noble
girl. She is a good person.

245
00:31:05,926 --> 00:31:12,165
Right, Ulgen? What do you think?
You stayed with them for a long time.

246
00:31:12,846 --> 00:31:17,445
Would Gonca be a good daughter-in-law?

247
00:31:21,046 --> 00:31:26,085
I... I don't know.

248
00:31:29,246 --> 00:31:33,245
Gonca Hatun! Gonca Hatun!

249
00:31:33,726 --> 00:31:34,514
Gonca Hatun!

250
00:31:34,526 --> 00:31:36,925
Ghazi Alp. What happened?
Why are you in a rush?

251
00:31:37,126 --> 00:31:42,845
What can happen? Someone wants to
see you again. They said it's important.

252
00:31:44,006 --> 00:31:48,525
-Who invited me?
-Alaeddin Bey.

253
00:31:48,766 --> 00:31:54,925
But... you cannot go anywhere
without me anymore. I'll come with you.

254
00:31:57,126 --> 00:32:02,845
Not today, Ghazi Alp. Besides, look what
I brought for you. Let me give it to you.

255
00:32:03,846 --> 00:32:07,125
This is for you.

256
00:32:11,326 --> 00:32:14,685
But...

257
00:32:16,126 --> 00:32:18,845
She is gone.

258
00:32:26,686 --> 00:32:30,245
-Do you also have something for me?
-No, VAIIah, my Shahzade.

259
00:32:30,566 --> 00:32:35,085
I lost Gonca Hatun because
of these. These are all mine!

260
00:32:38,766 --> 00:32:43,805
Good. Go and enjoy then.

261
00:32:48,606 --> 00:32:51,525
Why did you come, Orhan?

262
00:32:52,246 --> 00:32:55,245
Everyone is watching us. Don't you see?

263
00:32:55,406 --> 00:32:58,925
You know that I am waiting for your answer.

264
00:32:59,846 --> 00:33:05,725
I gave you an answer. I won't become Muslim.

265
00:33:09,406 --> 00:33:13,125
Holofira...

266
00:33:13,326 --> 00:33:18,245
What do you think is not reasonable? Ask me.

267
00:33:18,326 --> 00:33:21,365
Ask me, I will tell you about our religion.

268
00:33:21,606 --> 00:33:25,485
I know you need time. But..

269
00:33:25,726 --> 00:33:30,805
Do not reject my offer
without thinking about it. Look...

270
00:33:31,206 --> 00:33:36,645
I am saying that if you become
Muslim, we will get married.

271
00:33:38,046 --> 00:33:41,565
This is my mother's only condition.

272
00:33:46,086 --> 00:33:50,445
Why am I the one who has
to sacrifice something, Orhan?

273
00:33:52,646 --> 00:33:56,165
I will not be a Muslim.

274
00:33:57,166 --> 00:34:03,805
Look at me, I will never be a Muslim.

275
00:34:05,766 --> 00:34:08,445
Don't do this.

276
00:34:09,646 --> 00:34:11,885
Think about it.

277
00:34:20,286 --> 00:34:26,685
There's nothing to think about.
I've said what I have to say.

278
00:35:16,286 --> 00:35:19,165
I'm listening to you, Gonca.

279
00:35:20,006 --> 00:35:23,405
Are you playing hard to get again?

280
00:35:24,246 --> 00:35:30,405
No. I'm not playing hard to get.

281
00:35:30,806 --> 00:35:37,645
Then answer me. Coy woman.

282
00:35:39,446 --> 00:35:45,045
I'm thinking about how
am I going to tell you this.

283
00:35:46,126 --> 00:35:50,245
Alaeddin Bey.

284
00:35:54,286 --> 00:35:58,845
You misunderstood me.

285
00:35:59,566 --> 00:36:08,205
If you think I have feelings
for you, you're wrong.

286
00:36:16,046 --> 00:36:19,805
What are you saying, Gonca?

287
00:36:21,166 --> 00:36:25,125
You've heard me.

288
00:36:27,246 --> 00:36:30,645
I don't love you.

289
00:36:43,886 --> 00:36:48,925
-Don't get in my way anymore.
-Trickster woman.

290
00:36:52,686 --> 00:36:56,605
-What are you doing?
-What are you doing?

291
00:36:57,206 --> 00:37:01,005
-What does that mean, Gonca?
-You've heard me.

292
00:37:01,286 --> 00:37:04,285
-Move away.
-No.

293
00:37:04,406 --> 00:37:07,085
No, I don't get it.

294
00:37:08,206 --> 00:37:10,765
What has changed since yesterday?

295
00:37:10,886 --> 00:37:14,725
-Alaeddin, move away.
-Gonca.

296
00:37:15,446 --> 00:37:18,405
You asked me that

297
00:37:18,806 --> 00:37:22,885
"do you trust me?"

298
00:37:23,806 --> 00:37:26,605
I trust you.

299
00:37:29,046 --> 00:37:33,725
I trust you as much as I trust myself.

300
00:37:35,406 --> 00:37:41,725
But don't expect me to believe these words.

301
00:37:42,246 --> 00:37:46,485
Believe it or not.

302
00:37:48,366 --> 00:37:51,685
Go away now.

303
00:37:52,086 --> 00:37:58,445
Gonca. Gonca, what is the reason?

304
00:37:58,646 --> 00:38:05,245
Is it my family? Is it my mother?
Tell me something, Gonca.

305
00:38:06,846 --> 00:38:10,645
Alaeddin, move.

306
00:38:20,486 --> 00:38:23,805
Gonca.

307
00:38:25,446 --> 00:38:29,365
Then look me in the eye and tell me.

308
00:38:31,886 --> 00:38:35,965
Don't you love me?

309
00:38:36,166 --> 00:38:41,605
Alaeddin, don't force it.

310
00:38:44,526 --> 00:38:48,285
Don't get in my way again.

311
00:38:50,126 --> 00:38:53,005
Come on.

312
00:38:59,766 --> 00:39:02,725
Gonca!

313
00:39:06,046 --> 00:39:12,285
I don't believe what your
tongue says, I believe your eyes.

314
00:39:15,206 --> 00:39:18,645
-Come on!
-I believe your eyes.

315
00:39:19,646 --> 00:39:21,645
Your eyes.

316
00:39:23,166 --> 00:39:28,085
I got my answer.

317
00:39:41,326 --> 00:39:45,485
-Alaeddin.
-Brother.

318
00:39:51,326 --> 00:39:54,725
Look at me.

319
00:39:56,166 --> 00:39:58,925
What happened to you

320
00:40:00,006 --> 00:40:05,285
-Gonca doesn't love me, brother.
-What are you saying, Alaeddin?

321
00:40:08,006 --> 00:40:14,645
Brother. When I heard that

322
00:40:15,726 --> 00:40:20,605
my heart ached so much...

323
00:40:22,246 --> 00:40:26,685
...I thought I'd never breathe again.

324
00:40:29,726 --> 00:40:35,925
I wouldn't be able to breathe if her
eyes weren't saying something different.

325
00:40:36,246 --> 00:40:39,765
Eyes tell the truth, brother.

326
00:40:40,126 --> 00:40:44,325
We will not hear the words.

327
00:40:44,646 --> 00:40:48,205
What about you? What did you do?

328
00:40:48,526 --> 00:40:52,285
Did Holofira accept being a Muslim?

329
00:40:55,326 --> 00:41:00,645
She didn't. It seems she won't accept it.

330
00:41:01,206 --> 00:41:06,085
I'm stuck between my mother and Holofira.

331
00:41:06,446 --> 00:41:09,285
What are we going to do, brother?

332
00:41:10,086 --> 00:41:14,725
We will do our best. We will work hard.

333
00:41:14,886 --> 00:41:18,245
We will do our duty first.

334
00:41:20,446 --> 00:41:23,925
Think of it this way.

335
00:41:25,486 --> 00:41:31,885
I'm also dealing with Mehmed,
but your only opponent is Ghazi.

336
00:41:33,006 --> 00:41:37,485
Don't say that. Ghazi is
a tough opponent as well.

337
00:41:37,606 --> 00:41:42,205
All right, let’s see your
skills as well. Come on.

338
00:41:42,406 --> 00:41:45,085
Come on.

339
00:41:53,686 --> 00:41:57,325
Alps! Shoot the glorious arrows of Kayi!

340
00:41:57,406 --> 00:42:02,445
Allah is the Greatest.

341
00:42:03,646 --> 00:42:08,525
Nokers! Defend!

342
00:42:30,326 --> 00:42:34,365
Karecelasun, or whatever you are

343
00:42:36,526 --> 00:42:38,845
where are you going without dying?

344
00:42:38,966 --> 00:42:42,485
I did not die even in epic battles.

345
00:42:42,566 --> 00:42:45,125
Do you think I'd die in your hands, Osman?

346
00:42:45,206 --> 00:42:51,085
You will. Whoever comes
these lands and sheds blood

347
00:42:51,326 --> 00:42:57,285
will be buried in these lands. Alps!

348
00:42:58,126 --> 00:43:02,165
-Attack!
-Release the horses!

349
00:43:15,366 --> 00:43:18,285
Gonca. Are you all right?

350
00:43:18,486 --> 00:43:21,885
-I'm all right.
-Come.

351
00:43:29,366 --> 00:43:34,285
-What happened?
-I'm in such a trouble that

352
00:43:34,646 --> 00:43:37,125
-I can't even breathe now.
-All right.

353
00:43:37,286 --> 00:43:42,165
All right, come. Come, have a seat.

354
00:43:48,726 --> 00:43:51,645
What happened, tell me?

355
00:43:52,286 --> 00:43:56,205
Do you remember what I told you about Alaeddin?

356
00:43:56,286 --> 00:43:58,125
Let's keep it as a secret, all right?

357
00:43:58,206 --> 00:44:01,765
All right. I'll not tell anyone about it.

358
00:44:01,926 --> 00:44:05,445
But tell me, what bothers you so much?

359
00:44:06,886 --> 00:44:13,245
You told me that it is impossible
between you and Orhan Bey.

360
00:44:16,166 --> 00:44:19,165
It is impossible for us too now.

361
00:44:21,166 --> 00:44:24,325
Everything is over.

362
00:44:24,486 --> 00:44:29,645
But why? Because of your families?

363
00:44:30,846 --> 00:44:33,085
This is not something you can't overcome.

364
00:44:33,206 --> 00:44:37,365
Maybe the tension between
them will be over thanks to you.

365
00:44:38,166 --> 00:44:43,125
Both my family and...

366
00:44:46,046 --> 00:44:53,525
No. No, Holofira. There's
no such thing as "us".

367
00:44:53,886 --> 00:45:00,125
I told Alaeddin that I don't love him.

368
00:45:00,446 --> 00:45:05,765
-Everything is over.
-What did you do, Gonca?

369
00:45:11,686 --> 00:45:17,005
Gonca isn't acting by her heart
anymore. You should just know this.

370
00:45:20,206 --> 00:45:24,325
What about Alaaddin?
What did he say?

371
00:45:24,886 --> 00:45:27,605
He didn't believe.

372
00:45:30,486 --> 00:45:36,125
My Allah... I need to stay alone for a while.

373
00:45:36,446 --> 00:45:38,565
Thanks for everything.

374
00:45:53,326 --> 00:46:00,045
You drew Ilkhanid wrath on
you. But there won't be only this.

375
00:46:00,286 --> 00:46:03,165
Your frontiers will turn
into a bloodbath, Osman.

376
00:46:03,326 --> 00:46:05,565
We are not afraid of death.

377
00:46:05,726 --> 00:46:11,485
We will always walk on the
right path against the wrong.

378
00:47:31,086 --> 00:47:35,925
Brother, is your hand fully recovered?
Why are you carrying double swords?

379
00:47:37,126 --> 00:47:40,325
You got your answer?

380
00:47:40,646 --> 00:47:43,405
Yes, brother.

381
00:47:46,286 --> 00:47:49,685
You should still watch your back, brother.

382
00:47:54,086 --> 00:47:58,245
You call me brother.
You watch my back.

383
00:47:58,846 --> 00:48:01,565
-Come on. Come on!
-Come on.

384
00:48:39,726 --> 00:48:45,445
Osman... Don't take my sword!

385
00:48:46,366 --> 00:48:49,205
Do not touch!

386
00:48:59,526 --> 00:49:03,525
Osman!

387
00:49:10,126 --> 00:49:14,285
Osman, I will take your head!

388
00:49:17,486 --> 00:49:23,805
I will take your head and
be a legend here, Osman!

389
00:49:24,046 --> 00:49:30,205
-Your legend would be vain! You will die!
-Come on.

390
00:49:46,566 --> 00:49:50,685
Nokers, protect the commander...

391
00:49:55,326 --> 00:49:59,045
Nokers.

392
00:49:59,126 --> 00:50:03,005
-Draw back.
-Where are you going?

393
00:50:26,806 --> 00:50:34,365
You are running off again?
Running off again? Alps!

394
00:50:52,326 --> 00:50:55,765
Boran, send our best trackers after them.

395
00:50:55,766 --> 00:51:00,565
Sure, my Bey. Yagiz, Dumrul, Ayaz. Come on!

396
00:51:01,686 --> 00:51:05,045
Before even the blood of
Gurbuz and our martyrs dried,

397
00:51:05,126 --> 00:51:07,725
...we slaughtered all the dogs, my Bey.

398
00:51:07,766 --> 00:51:10,885
But we couldn't take the
head of the leading dog yet.

399
00:51:10,886 --> 00:51:15,085
Don't be worrying! We'll take
revenge from the heathens.

400
00:51:15,286 --> 00:51:19,405
I took that dog's sword
and will take his life too.

401
00:51:19,766 --> 00:51:22,765
If Allah permits, my Bey.

402
00:51:27,286 --> 00:51:30,285
Germiyanoglu Border / Border Market

403
00:51:30,926 --> 00:51:36,365
Orhan doesn't care about you,
Holofira. He only cares about himself.

404
00:51:36,686 --> 00:51:39,925
Why would you sacrifice?

405
00:51:40,246 --> 00:51:45,485
He doesn't know how important
what he wants me to do is to me.

406
00:51:46,166 --> 00:51:51,965
What does he even do? Look
what he has done to Aysima.

407
00:51:53,086 --> 00:51:55,605
I'm sorry about that girl.

408
00:51:55,846 --> 00:52:00,205
-After what she did?
-She was blinded by her anger.

409
00:52:00,686 --> 00:52:03,245
I can't be angry with her.

410
00:52:04,486 --> 00:52:10,525
They disgraced her. Unbelievable.
Everybody is talking about you.

411
00:52:11,846 --> 00:52:13,125
Still?

412
00:52:14,886 --> 00:52:20,845
Orhan's walking around you bothered people.

413
00:52:21,446 --> 00:52:24,845
They said he would marry Aysima.

414
00:52:25,486 --> 00:52:28,445
So people got confused.

415
00:52:29,886 --> 00:52:33,965
These are not appropriate, Holofira.

416
00:52:34,406 --> 00:52:39,445
It's not my fault. You know that.

417
00:52:40,566 --> 00:52:43,525
Of course it's not.

418
00:52:43,846 --> 00:52:48,765
Orhan does everything but you and Aysima...

419
00:52:48,926 --> 00:52:52,005
...get harm.

420
00:52:52,406 --> 00:52:55,885
Actually, there is something more important.

421
00:52:57,406 --> 00:53:00,005
My aunt.

422
00:53:01,246 --> 00:53:04,685
I didn't tell her about anything going on here.

423
00:53:05,126 --> 00:53:08,085
But she realized.

424
00:53:09,526 --> 00:53:12,885
She always does.

425
00:53:14,006 --> 00:53:17,245
She keeps pushing me.

426
00:53:18,326 --> 00:53:21,965
I don't know what to do.

427
00:53:29,686 --> 00:53:31,405
I do.

428
00:53:34,766 --> 00:53:36,565
I think...

429
00:53:38,086 --> 00:53:41,085
...your aunt and I should meet.

430
00:53:43,486 --> 00:53:46,325
What do you think?

431
00:54:02,166 --> 00:54:06,045
Guice, speak. What's going on?

432
00:54:06,286 --> 00:54:11,485
Gonca Hatun told Alaaddin
Bey she didn't love him.

433
00:54:16,606 --> 00:54:21,085
Good. Now we have something else to do.

434
00:54:21,286 --> 00:54:27,685
We'll make preparations. We're
going to meet Holofira's family tonight.

435
00:54:30,166 --> 00:54:34,245
Obviously, they will ask
for Holofira for marriage.

436
00:54:34,926 --> 00:54:39,805
Nobody knows that. Keep your mouth shut.

437
00:54:44,326 --> 00:54:49,885
Which brother should I be upset about
now? I should go to the palace immediately.

438
00:54:56,806 --> 00:54:59,445
Come on.

439
00:55:05,566 --> 00:55:11,125
Whatever happens helps Osman.
He's drawing beys one by one on his side.

440
00:55:12,806 --> 00:55:15,645
I will show all of them the truth.

441
00:55:15,926 --> 00:55:21,325
But Cerkutay has an account to give first.

442
00:55:23,966 --> 00:55:29,805
I sent him to the palace to
be my eyes and ears there.

443
00:55:31,046 --> 00:55:34,405
But he became deaf an mute.

444
00:55:36,006 --> 00:55:40,005
Osman grew his reputation bigger
by attacking the caravan of weapons.

445
00:55:40,286 --> 00:55:45,005
-If he knew but didn't tell us...
-He will pay for it.

446
00:55:45,366 --> 00:55:51,565
But we will be sure first.

447
00:56:02,166 --> 00:56:05,605
There is an important matter, Yakup Bey.

448
00:56:05,766 --> 00:56:09,165
-What is it, hatun?
-Something good.

449
00:56:09,286 --> 00:56:13,645
Very good, actually. Holofira...

450
00:56:16,126 --> 00:56:18,685
...is so confused.

451
00:56:18,926 --> 00:56:23,685
-Did she say something? Did she accept?
-No.

452
00:56:23,966 --> 00:56:26,845
But she knows we want to meet her aunt...

453
00:56:26,966 --> 00:56:31,045
...because of what happened here.

454
00:56:31,286 --> 00:56:36,525
But will we do more than just meeting.

455
00:56:41,886 --> 00:56:45,445
Are you sure about your decision, Mehmed?

456
00:56:46,086 --> 00:56:48,965
That's what matters.

457
00:56:50,886 --> 00:56:55,525
I will do whatever my mother and father say.

458
00:56:55,606 --> 00:56:59,885
Then we will handle this thing.

459
00:57:00,646 --> 00:57:07,005
Make your preparations,
hatun. We will both meet...

460
00:57:07,326 --> 00:57:10,925
...and take the girl.

461
00:57:16,366 --> 00:57:19,565
-Did you hand out the swords?
-We handed them all out, my bey.

462
00:57:19,566 --> 00:57:21,623
Those who went to beys
should've arrived by now.

463
00:57:21,635 --> 00:57:22,325
Alright.

464
00:57:22,326 --> 00:57:26,485
The alps there retreated to the
encampment without losing caution, my bey.

465
00:57:26,486 --> 00:57:31,445
The swords will be at the encampment tomorrow.

466
00:57:31,806 --> 00:57:35,965
-However, no one will know, Cerkutay.
-Okay, my bey.

467
00:57:36,246 --> 00:57:40,925
Alps, the conquest of Kite is very important.

468
00:57:41,006 --> 00:57:45,405
However, no one will act independently.

469
00:57:45,526 --> 00:57:49,445
-Okay my bey.
-That place will fall sooner or later.

470
00:57:49,606 --> 00:57:53,245
However, now it is waiting for its time.

471
00:57:53,326 --> 00:57:58,165
The sons are after Ayhan.
Before those mongols reassamble..

472
00:57:58,326 --> 00:58:02,165
If we find that crusader dog, not only Kite..

473
00:58:02,366 --> 00:58:05,445
But we will walk to Iznik to Bursa if Allah permits

474
00:58:05,526 --> 00:58:08,565
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-If Allah permits.

475
00:58:08,686 --> 00:58:12,445
We will see after the sons
come back with their hands full.

476
00:58:15,966 --> 00:58:20,685
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too, Aykurt.

477
00:58:20,926 --> 00:58:23,325
Did we do our last duty for Gurbuz?

478
00:58:23,446 --> 00:58:27,805
We did, my bey. Our brother Gurbuz..

479
00:58:28,006 --> 00:58:32,285
And the other martyr alps have reached Allah.

480
00:58:32,366 --> 00:58:37,565
Their graves and their bravery
will last forever, if Allah permits.

481
00:58:37,886 --> 00:58:41,565
If Allah permits.

482
00:58:45,246 --> 00:58:50,405
This mace that belonged to Gurbuz is now yours.

483
00:58:50,806 --> 00:58:53,845
Preserve it as it deserves.

484
00:58:54,566 --> 00:58:59,245
Okay my bey. Okay.

485
00:58:59,806 --> 00:59:02,525
Those who broke our brother Gurbuz...

486
00:59:02,686 --> 00:59:05,805
The heads of those who made our alps martyrs...

487
00:59:05,886 --> 00:59:09,165
Will be crushed by these mace
if Allah permits.

488
00:59:09,286 --> 00:59:14,245
We did not wander around as
well, brother. We scattered them.

489
00:59:14,326 --> 00:59:17,765
We spilled the blood of those who spilled ours.

490
00:59:18,366 --> 00:59:22,645
Thank Allah. Our martyrs
will sleep peacefully if Allah permits.

491
00:59:22,726 --> 00:59:25,565
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

492
00:59:25,686 --> 00:59:33,045
Those who walk on the right path, only
find peace when they become martyrs.

493
00:59:34,686 --> 00:59:37,085
May they rest peacefully, if Allah permits.

494
00:59:37,166 --> 00:59:40,805
-Ameen.
-Ameen.

495
00:59:42,526 --> 00:59:46,165
Place the flying flames where
I told you, but be very careful.

496
00:59:46,286 --> 00:59:49,565
Their eyes are on us. Clean up this place.

497
00:59:49,646 --> 00:59:52,685
Ayhan Aga, open the door.

498
00:59:52,766 --> 00:59:56,325
I will stall them.
Clean this place.

499
00:59:56,406 --> 00:59:58,165
-Understood, master.
-Come on.

500
00:59:58,286 --> 01:00:01,645
Ayhan Aga, don't think a
sherbet is too much trouble.

501
01:00:01,726 --> 01:00:04,525
Be ready.

502
01:00:07,446 --> 01:00:11,125
We will take lives if needed. Open the door.

503
01:00:11,246 --> 01:00:15,005
Ayhan Aga, open the door.

504
01:00:20,566 --> 01:00:28,205
-Peace be upon you. Ayhan Aga.
-Peace be upon you, may Allah's mercy be upon you.

505
01:00:28,566 --> 01:00:34,165
My shahzade. What is it, at this hour?

506
01:00:34,486 --> 01:00:37,085
What is it that brought you to my door?

507
01:00:37,246 --> 01:00:42,365
-What, did we disturb you?
-Of course not, my shahzade.

508
01:00:42,726 --> 01:00:46,965
Of course not. I was thinking of you.

509
01:00:47,206 --> 01:00:53,525
If you sent the word, I would've
come to you, my shahzade.

510
01:00:53,646 --> 01:00:56,285
-You wouldn't get tired.
-If we call you..

511
01:00:56,366 --> 01:00:59,645
Of course, you will come Ayhan Aga.
However, we wanted..

512
01:00:59,806 --> 01:01:04,805
To come and see you in your place.

513
01:01:05,006 --> 01:01:07,805
There are complaints about you.

514
01:01:07,926 --> 01:01:11,805
-There are complaints about me?
-Complaints.

515
01:01:12,446 --> 01:01:16,325
I don't know who made a complaint, however..

516
01:01:16,526 --> 01:01:21,045
My shahzades, my beys with alps before them..

517
01:01:21,246 --> 01:01:24,285
Came all the way to my door. My shahzade..

518
01:01:24,366 --> 01:01:26,965
I do not have beef with anyone.

519
01:01:27,046 --> 01:01:34,085
This is how we do things, Ayhan Aga.
The son of bey comes to the smalles issue.

520
01:01:34,246 --> 01:01:37,885
That is why our necks are tough.

521
01:01:39,166 --> 01:01:43,445
-Tell him, Bayindir Bey.
-Ayhan Aga.

522
01:01:43,726 --> 01:01:48,165
They say you take goods from
west and sell them at frontiers.

523
01:01:48,326 --> 01:01:53,685
You don't even give the
tax and fiddle with prices.

524
01:01:54,006 --> 01:01:57,885
Osman Bey wants to know what is up.

525
01:01:58,046 --> 01:02:02,925
May Allah protect us. It is slander, a lie!

526
01:02:03,006 --> 01:02:07,645
Those snake tongue devils play trickery on me!

527
01:02:07,926 --> 01:02:12,885
My shahzade, may Allah protect
me. How can I ever betray to..

528
01:02:12,966 --> 01:02:17,805
This mighty state, to Osman
Bey! If I betrayed even a little bit..

529
01:02:17,966 --> 01:02:22,525
May Allah not allow me to get
out from this door! It is slander!

530
01:02:22,606 --> 01:02:28,645
Anything can be expected
from humanity, Ayhan Aga.

531
01:02:29,006 --> 01:02:32,645
Ya Allah.

532
01:02:33,486 --> 01:02:39,285
Now tell me. You won't defy
Osman Bey's command, right?

533
01:02:39,526 --> 01:02:43,525
Of course not. The house is yours.

534
01:02:43,606 --> 01:02:46,845
-Alright.
-And you are responsible..

535
01:02:46,966 --> 01:02:49,925
With what we find here, Ayhan Aga.

536
01:02:50,086 --> 01:02:55,845
-Of course, my shahzade.
-Search everywhere.

537
01:02:56,206 --> 01:03:01,285
Search, so that we will have no doubts.

538
01:03:01,486 --> 01:03:04,205
As you command, my shahzade.

539
01:03:09,726 --> 01:03:15,605
Ayhan Aga, tell me. What is behind this door?

540
01:03:16,406 --> 01:03:22,845
Don't waste your breath Ayhan
Aga. I can show it to my shahzade.

541
01:04:27,486 --> 01:04:31,645
Baysungur, stay with Ayhan Aga.

542
01:04:36,446 --> 01:04:40,125
There are no traces here, my bey.

543
01:05:08,206 --> 01:05:14,365
There were. However they took it away.

544
01:05:22,326 --> 01:05:25,885
-This is flying fire.
-He smile at our face..

545
01:05:26,126 --> 01:05:29,285
And play trickery behind us.

546
01:05:29,726 --> 01:05:34,645
Now he will pay for it.

547
01:05:37,766 --> 01:05:41,485
-You are under arrest, Ayhan.
-I did not expect us to meet this early.

548
01:05:41,566 --> 01:05:44,245
However, we will meet again.
I will have your head.

549
01:05:44,446 --> 01:05:48,285
You were a friend, got our
favors. Now you will face our wrath.

550
01:05:48,406 --> 01:05:52,965
What a wrath it is. I will be back!

551
01:06:18,046 --> 01:06:22,525
Come on! After him, quickly!

552
01:06:28,366 --> 01:06:32,445
-Malhun, look at them.
-Yes?

553
01:06:34,046 --> 01:06:38,045
Bala, they are beautiful.

554
01:06:38,846 --> 01:06:42,165
You are preparing a dowery, however..

555
01:06:42,606 --> 01:06:47,325
It is not certain for Gonca
to say yes to Alaeddin.

556
01:06:48,926 --> 01:06:54,485
Ulgen, you are hiding something.
However, you are not telling us.

557
01:06:56,086 --> 01:07:00,685
-No, what can I say?
-Bala is right.

558
01:07:00,766 --> 01:07:04,085
If you know something,
tell us now. This is marriage.

559
01:07:04,166 --> 01:07:06,925
It is important. It is not something easy.

560
01:07:07,006 --> 01:07:12,605
I don't know... Being
co-in-laws with Saadet Hatun...

561
01:07:18,046 --> 01:07:22,445
What can I do? They
fell in love with each other.

562
01:07:22,926 --> 01:07:28,725
Right... Look at Orhan. We couldn't make
him give up no matter what we told him.

563
01:07:29,246 --> 01:07:31,565
Instead of losing our children...

564
01:07:31,686 --> 01:07:35,845
What if you lose your
children with this marriage?

565
01:07:44,166 --> 01:07:46,805
Mother... -Yes my daughter.

566
01:07:46,886 --> 01:07:48,874
What are you doing here?

567
01:07:48,886 --> 01:07:52,165
They are preparing
Gonca Hatun's dowry.

568
01:07:53,566 --> 01:07:57,365
You are doing this for no reason.

569
01:07:57,446 --> 01:08:00,685
Gonca Hatun does not love my brother.

570
01:08:09,246 --> 01:08:13,325
What are you saying Fatma?
Where is Alaeddin now?

571
01:08:13,406 --> 01:08:17,805
I was looking for my brother. But
he is not here, he is doing his duty.

572
01:08:20,805 --> 01:08:23,845
It was not in our destiny.

573
01:08:26,966 --> 01:08:32,925
There is something else... If my Orhan
brother hears this, there will be a disaster.

574
01:08:33,006 --> 01:08:35,365
What?

575
01:08:35,765 --> 01:08:37,511
Tell me Fatma. What is it?

576
01:08:37,523 --> 01:08:41,365
They are going to ask for
Holofira's hand for Mehmet Bey.

577
01:08:48,206 --> 01:08:53,645
Fatma... Your brother must
not hear this. Don't you tell him.

578
01:08:54,406 --> 01:08:58,085
Fatma! Did you hear me?

579
01:09:00,206 --> 01:09:03,444
Alright mother. Alright.

580
01:09:06,166 --> 01:09:09,564
Hatuns! Hatuns!

581
01:09:09,645 --> 01:09:13,404
Osman Bey is coming! I wanted to inform you.

582
01:09:16,765 --> 01:09:21,325
Come on. Let's take these away.

583
01:09:34,886 --> 01:09:39,365
There was a secret passage in the house,
my Bey. The dog who we thought was Ayhan...

584
01:09:39,526 --> 01:09:42,885
...was even prepared for this day.

585
01:09:43,166 --> 01:09:51,365
Right, my son. Right. Those men plan
their escape before they plan their moves.

586
01:09:51,725 --> 01:09:57,725
Tell me. What else did
you see in Ayhan's house?

587
01:09:58,846 --> 01:10:02,605
When we checked the room
behind the secret passage...

588
01:10:02,846 --> 01:10:05,725
...we found the tracks of flying flame, my Bey.

589
01:10:07,406 --> 01:10:13,085
Apparently, they took flying
flames out while wasting our time.

590
01:10:16,926 --> 01:10:21,805
Since he put his life at
risk for the flying flame...

591
01:10:22,966 --> 01:10:25,805
...he must be after a big move, my Bey.

592
01:10:26,086 --> 01:10:29,365
Who knows where and how they plan to hurt us?

593
01:10:29,446 --> 01:10:35,245
He came and joined our table. He made us
believe that he was Ayhan Agha. Dastard dog.

594
01:10:36,086 --> 01:10:41,765
Still, we will be more careful. We cannot
let what happened in Sogut happen again.

595
01:10:41,886 --> 01:10:46,005
Right. But now, we know him.

596
01:10:46,446 --> 01:10:53,485
He has no where to escape.
We will cut his head off.

597
01:10:54,606 --> 01:11:00,205
Tell me. War preparations
continue secretly, right?

598
01:11:00,286 --> 01:11:04,805
-Right, my Bey. As you ordered.
-Thank you, thank you.

599
01:11:04,886 --> 01:11:09,645
Now... Announce it to everyone...

600
01:11:09,726 --> 01:11:14,245
...announce it, so that dog can also hear it.

601
01:11:14,446 --> 01:11:19,085
-Yes my Bey.
-What is your goal, my Bey?

602
01:11:20,486 --> 01:11:26,325
The jackal will think that the wolf's cave
is empty. He will, so he can feel our teeth.

603
01:11:27,446 --> 01:11:29,405
What about Karacelasun dog?

604
01:11:29,486 --> 01:11:34,525
He was assigned to Konya as a
Governor. He is working with crusaders.

605
01:11:43,526 --> 01:11:51,125
Karacelasun cannot do
anything to us for some time.

606
01:11:51,246 --> 01:11:56,245
We ruined him.

607
01:12:00,486 --> 01:12:04,965
-Father!
-My Fatma!

608
01:12:05,326 --> 01:12:09,045
My beautiful daughter...
My beautiful daughter...

609
01:12:09,206 --> 01:12:13,285
This is that dog's sword. Did you kill him?

610
01:12:13,366 --> 01:12:18,565
No... Not yet. But soon, it will happen.

611
01:12:20,286 --> 01:12:25,325
Come here. Alps... Go back to your duties.

612
01:12:25,486 --> 01:12:29,925
-Okay my Bey.
-So, my daughter?

613
01:12:30,486 --> 01:12:33,365
Prepare a good table for us.

614
01:12:33,446 --> 01:12:38,005
-Yes my Bey.
-Go now. Go.

615
01:12:43,566 --> 01:12:49,405
Ayhan Agha passed away...
He was a talented trader.

616
01:12:50,246 --> 01:12:55,445
Now they will face Master Gera.

617
01:12:55,606 --> 01:13:00,645
From now on, we will not
hide. With all our strength...

618
01:13:00,886 --> 01:13:02,845
..we will attack them.

619
01:13:02,966 --> 01:13:07,325
Finally! Finally, we are
getting into a real war.

620
01:13:07,406 --> 01:13:10,765
We are, Vasilis.

621
01:13:11,766 --> 01:13:15,205
What are you planning

622
01:13:23,446 --> 01:13:31,125
Both Germiyan and Kayi want
Holofira to be their daughter-in-law.

623
01:13:31,286 --> 01:13:34,645
Is that right?

624
01:13:40,046 --> 01:13:44,685
You waited all this time
until you told me this, Andra.

625
01:13:47,966 --> 01:13:51,925
Didn't I tell you to...

626
01:13:52,006 --> 01:13:55,165
...inform me about every step Holofira takes?

627
01:13:55,286 --> 01:13:57,765
-My Hanim... I...
-Shut up!

628
01:13:58,006 --> 01:14:00,565
Don't say another word!

629
01:14:04,526 --> 01:14:08,925
Those immoral Turks went too far.

630
01:14:11,846 --> 01:14:17,125
But I know what to do to them.

631
01:14:22,686 --> 01:14:26,165
Holofira..

632
01:14:26,446 --> 01:14:29,925
Is everything ready for our guests?

633
01:14:30,086 --> 01:14:32,845
Yes, aunt.

634
01:14:34,526 --> 01:14:38,245
Andra? Are you alright?

635
01:14:38,326 --> 01:14:40,645
Andra is alright.

636
01:14:42,846 --> 01:14:46,565
Go. Help them get ready.

637
01:14:49,566 --> 01:14:53,565
Why is Yakup Bey coming, Holofira?

638
01:14:53,686 --> 01:15:00,525
I don't know aunt. I am also curious.

639
01:15:01,286 --> 01:15:06,445
Saadet Hatun... I guess she wants to meet you.

640
01:15:09,646 --> 01:15:15,445
Maybe this is the best for Orhan
and Holofira. What can we do?

641
01:15:15,766 --> 01:15:18,885
I think Holofira will not accept this.

642
01:15:19,166 --> 01:15:25,845
I don't understand... I don't
understand why Saadet asks for Holofira.

643
01:15:27,206 --> 01:15:33,045
I know what her problem is, but
she won't be able to achieve her goals.

644
01:15:33,926 --> 01:15:37,925
Mother... When my brother learns
that Mehmet Bey asked for Holofira...

645
01:15:38,006 --> 01:15:41,485
Don't! Don't you dare, Fatma.

646
01:15:44,286 --> 01:15:47,965
Your brother will not hear about this.

647
01:15:49,686 --> 01:15:52,805
What am I not supposed to hear?

648
01:15:55,886 --> 01:15:58,925
Huh?

649
01:16:01,406 --> 01:16:02,725
Fatma?

650
01:16:18,046 --> 01:16:21,165
My sister...

651
01:16:21,366 --> 01:16:25,805
Come on, tell me. Do not make me repeat.

652
01:16:26,806 --> 01:16:30,183
Mehmet Bey went to
ask for Holofira's hand.

653
01:16:30,195 --> 01:16:31,325
Fatma!

654
01:16:35,566 --> 01:16:38,965
What?

655
01:16:43,766 --> 01:16:47,685
Are you telling that to me now, my sister?

656
01:16:54,086 --> 01:16:58,165
I... know what to do to Mehmet.

657
01:16:58,406 --> 01:17:02,005
-The girl I love...
-Did the girl you love...

658
01:17:02,206 --> 01:17:04,805
...accepted becoming a Muslim, Orhan Bey?

659
01:17:04,966 --> 01:17:09,085
Mother... This is not the right time. Don't.

660
01:17:09,486 --> 01:17:12,885
Orhan! This is the right time!

661
01:17:13,046 --> 01:17:15,965
Did Holofira accept becoming a Muslim?

662
01:17:16,046 --> 01:17:22,205
She did not! She said she
would never become a Muslim!

663
01:17:22,286 --> 01:17:24,725
Was this the answer you expected?

664
01:17:25,486 --> 01:17:30,285
Are you pleased now? Was this
the thing you asked for, mother?

665
01:17:35,286 --> 01:17:37,365
-I just wanted you...
-Right!

666
01:17:37,606 --> 01:17:42,165
You wanted me to be happy, right?

667
01:17:42,926 --> 01:17:49,045
Look... Do I look happy now?

668
01:17:51,006 --> 01:17:55,133
Then... we will abduct
her, my Shahzade!

669
01:17:55,145 --> 01:17:56,525
Ghazi!

670
01:18:00,846 --> 01:18:05,085
What is happening here?

671
01:18:05,246 --> 01:18:10,245
Malhun? Orhan?

672
01:18:12,246 --> 01:18:16,285
Who is abducting whom? Tell me.

673
01:18:17,086 --> 01:18:23,005
Yakup Bey... He went to ask
for Holofira's hand, my Bey.

674
01:18:25,446 --> 01:18:30,085
Father, with your permission, I can't stay.

675
01:18:30,526 --> 01:18:35,605
-I'll go and take Holofira.
-I don't allow it, Orhan.

676
01:18:39,766 --> 01:18:42,245
-You will not go.
-Father.

677
01:18:42,326 --> 01:18:45,165
Orhan.

678
01:18:50,086 --> 01:18:53,885
If you try to go now,

679
01:18:54,126 --> 01:18:58,885
You'll be giving Yakup a
leverage. I won't let you do that.

680
01:19:00,606 --> 01:19:05,005
How can I stay, father?

681
01:19:06,206 --> 01:19:11,485
-Tell me, how can I stay?
-Son.

682
01:19:14,966 --> 01:19:18,605
They just went there to
ask for her hand in marriage.

683
01:19:19,526 --> 01:19:24,285
If she doesn't want it,
her family won't allow it.

684
01:19:24,366 --> 01:19:26,685
And Holofira will not accept.

685
01:19:27,046 --> 01:19:30,325
-Father...
-Orhan.

686
01:19:37,926 --> 01:19:40,965
Otherwise

687
01:19:42,966 --> 01:19:47,685
we will do as Ghazi says.

688
01:19:50,766 --> 01:19:54,685
If Holofira does not accept, of course.

689
01:20:03,926 --> 01:20:08,405
Excuse me, my Bey.

690
01:20:08,606 --> 01:20:11,405
He will kidnap her for sure, my Bey.

691
01:20:13,446 --> 01:20:19,605
Olivia Hatun, we didn't
get a chance to meet before.

692
01:20:19,726 --> 01:20:23,285
It is nice to meet you, Sultan Yakup.

693
01:20:23,646 --> 01:20:29,845
But I am curious about the
reason for your sudden visit.

694
01:20:35,366 --> 01:20:39,365
I hope there's nothing unpleasant.

695
01:20:40,606 --> 01:20:45,365
Where Holofira is, there is
no unpleasantness of any kind.

696
01:20:46,646 --> 01:20:53,165
We like Holofira a lot.
You raised her pretty well.

697
01:20:53,606 --> 01:20:56,525
Praise be!

698
01:21:00,566 --> 01:21:07,965
Holofira is my most precious one.
She's the only memory I have of my sister.

699
01:21:10,406 --> 01:21:14,765
I didn't want to send her to
Frontier Marketplace at first.

700
01:21:14,886 --> 01:21:18,005
But she insisted so
much that I couldn't resist.

701
01:21:18,846 --> 01:21:25,885
I'm glad that she insisted
on it and we got to meet.

702
01:21:27,566 --> 01:21:32,045
Right?

703
01:21:33,166 --> 01:21:35,925
That's right. That's right.

704
01:21:36,246 --> 01:21:43,405
Holofira is as precious to us as she is to you.

705
01:21:44,766 --> 01:21:49,005
I don't like talking in circles.

706
01:21:49,966 --> 01:21:54,165
With the order of Allah

707
01:21:58,686 --> 01:22:02,085
and words of the Prophet (PBUH),

708
01:22:03,286 --> 01:22:09,085
I want Holofira for my son Mehmed.

709
01:22:20,966 --> 01:22:26,325
Mehmed! Mehmed!

710
01:22:26,686 --> 01:22:31,485
You're walking towards your death, Mehmed!

711
01:22:36,366 --> 01:22:41,325
And if I'm Orhan..

712
01:22:41,406 --> 01:22:49,845
...if I'm Orhan, I'll make you pay for this!

713
01:22:50,326 --> 01:22:55,205
Brother, brother. Don't do this.

714
01:22:55,366 --> 01:22:58,925
-What are you doing? Pull yourself together.
-How can I stay?

715
01:22:59,366 --> 01:23:02,445
How can I stay, Alaeddin?
That dastard named Mehmed

716
01:23:02,566 --> 01:23:06,245
went to ask the woman I love to marry him.

717
01:23:06,366 --> 01:23:08,725
-I can't stay, I'll go.
-Brother!

718
01:23:08,806 --> 01:23:12,405
Brother, just calm down.

719
01:23:12,646 --> 01:23:16,245
If I hadn't heard, I wouldn't have known.

720
01:23:16,366 --> 01:23:21,445
How could my mother and
my sister hide it from me?

721
01:23:21,566 --> 01:23:27,645
Just take a breath. Come,
sit down and take a breath.

722
01:23:34,206 --> 01:23:37,205
Listen to me first.

723
01:23:37,406 --> 01:23:43,445
If you go now, you'll
make Holofira even angrier.

724
01:23:44,366 --> 01:23:49,965
You can go to the marketplace
tomorrow and find out the truth.

725
01:23:50,166 --> 01:23:54,445
Also I do not think Holofira
would accept it, brother.

726
01:23:55,686 --> 01:23:59,845
She wouldn't, right? She
wouldn't, right brother?

727
01:24:00,126 --> 01:24:03,885
-Of course she wouldn't.
-She wouldn't.

728
01:24:05,286 --> 01:24:11,725
But I forced her a lot. She
said I won't be a Muslim

729
01:24:11,926 --> 01:24:16,165
-but I pushed her.
-No.

730
01:24:16,406 --> 01:24:21,845
Holofira is a smart girl, she
knows why you're doing it.

731
01:24:23,126 --> 01:24:26,765
Of course she knows it.

732
01:24:28,086 --> 01:24:31,445
She doesn't say it to me.

733
01:24:31,646 --> 01:24:34,965
But I know.

734
01:24:36,886 --> 01:24:41,605
Holofira loves me too. I know it.

735
01:24:44,726 --> 01:24:50,525
I heard about it. Fatma
told me. My father said it too.

736
01:24:50,846 --> 01:24:53,976
Just because they asked for her for marriage...

737
01:24:53,976 --> 01:24:57,096
it doesn't mean it's going to happen.
Let's say they accepted it,

738
01:24:57,406 --> 01:25:02,485
then we will go and kidnap her, brother.

739
01:25:05,086 --> 01:25:08,285
Then we will go and kidnap her.

740
01:25:20,486 --> 01:25:25,845
But it seems like we will
kidnap two women, right?

741
01:25:26,286 --> 01:25:28,885
-Alaeddin.
-Brother.

742
01:25:28,966 --> 01:25:32,845
Thank you. Thank you.

743
01:25:33,646 --> 01:25:37,485
Alaeddin.

744
01:25:38,126 --> 01:25:42,645
Even our destiny was written at the same time.

745
01:25:43,926 --> 01:25:49,645
-We have the same trouble.
-That's right, brother.

746
01:26:01,846 --> 01:26:04,605
-Hey, what about me?
-I resent you.

747
01:26:04,886 --> 01:26:10,805
Your tongue speaks everything one can think of,
but how could you not tell me this, sister?

748
01:26:11,006 --> 01:26:14,445
Brother.

749
01:26:16,766 --> 01:26:20,885
I was afraid of my mother, brother.

750
01:26:21,166 --> 01:26:26,125
Otherwise I swear I would
say it. I can't hurt you.

751
01:26:26,326 --> 01:26:31,125
All right, I forgive you for now.

752
01:26:34,566 --> 01:26:38,365
Alaeddin brother.

753
01:26:39,766 --> 01:26:42,565
Bala mother.

754
01:26:49,926 --> 01:26:54,565
Vasilis knows Yenisehir
like the palm of his hand.

755
01:26:54,726 --> 01:27:01,485
If they close one gate, he knows very
well where another gate will lead us.

756
01:27:02,406 --> 01:27:09,485
Knowing the gates is not
enough to win a battle, Gera.

757
01:27:09,966 --> 01:27:13,525
No, no. You don't get it, Mongol.

758
01:27:14,006 --> 01:27:18,125
Think about the ambush we set against Yakup.

759
01:27:18,206 --> 01:27:24,605
Think about how the Beys there
were worried and lost their faith.

760
01:27:24,726 --> 01:27:28,685
They all rely on Osman only.

761
01:27:29,486 --> 01:27:33,045
The hearts of all Muslims
are beating in Yenisehir.

762
01:27:33,246 --> 01:27:37,456
The hearts of all Muslims
are beating in Yenisehir,

763
01:27:37,456 --> 01:27:40,056
and we are keeping that heart in our hands.

764
01:27:40,966 --> 01:27:45,525
Osman will attack our
castles like a hungry wolf.

765
01:27:45,686 --> 01:27:49,525
When he set out on his
first military expedition

766
01:27:50,246 --> 01:27:54,765
Yenisehir will be left to us.

767
01:27:55,446 --> 01:28:00,165
Yenisehir, his family and his precious people,

768
01:28:00,286 --> 01:28:05,045
he will lose everything he has.

769
01:28:06,246 --> 01:28:09,845
I liked your plan, Crusader.

770
01:28:09,966 --> 01:28:17,045
Spend the night here, we will
talk about everything. Everything.

771
01:28:17,206 --> 01:28:22,285
Very well, I liked your plan too, Mongol.

772
01:28:24,526 --> 01:28:27,245
I don't believe her, mother.

773
01:28:28,286 --> 01:28:31,125
I got my answer from her eyes that day.

774
01:28:31,246 --> 01:28:36,285
But today she was someone else, not Gonca.

775
01:28:36,526 --> 01:28:41,645
Maybe there's something she is afraid of.

776
01:28:42,366 --> 01:28:49,845
Yes. There's something she's
afraid of that we do not now, mother.

777
01:28:51,886 --> 01:28:56,645
-But I'll find it out.
-You will.

778
01:29:00,406 --> 01:29:06,685
My brave boy grew up
and fell in love, is that so?

779
01:29:10,486 --> 01:29:13,685
Look at you.

780
01:29:14,646 --> 01:29:19,805
-What are you talking as mother and son?
-It's not something important, my Bey.

781
01:29:22,566 --> 01:29:26,765
It isn't important, is that so?

782
01:29:28,286 --> 01:29:31,645
Alaeddin.

783
01:29:32,166 --> 01:29:37,085
You're secretive, are you
secretive to your father as well?

784
01:29:37,326 --> 01:29:40,285
Astagfirullah, father.

785
01:29:42,646 --> 01:29:48,085
I'll tell you about it, but I'll say it
when the time comes, my Bey.

786
01:29:53,766 --> 01:29:57,405
Okay. so, has Orhan calmed down?

787
01:29:57,486 --> 01:30:02,005
He's all right, he's better.

788
01:30:03,206 --> 01:30:04,965
With your permission, father.

789
01:30:06,486 --> 01:30:09,605
You have it.

790
01:30:20,606 --> 01:30:25,405
Well, Bala Hatun... Tell me.

791
01:30:25,926 --> 01:30:31,485
-Who does Alaaddin love?
-Think about it.

792
01:30:33,286 --> 01:30:36,165
Say it, father Osman.

793
01:30:37,606 --> 01:30:40,685
-I can see it in my son's eyes.
-Well?

794
01:30:42,046 --> 01:30:44,685
Alaaddin loves Gonca.

795
01:30:45,086 --> 01:30:48,965
Oh... Look at Osman Bey.

796
01:30:50,046 --> 01:30:54,125
State affairs and sons are different things.

797
01:30:55,726 --> 01:30:58,845
But we should think carefully.

798
01:31:00,126 --> 01:31:04,005
Alaaddin told Gonca he loves her.

799
01:31:04,366 --> 01:31:10,325
But Gonca said she doesn't lover him back.

800
01:31:14,606 --> 01:31:17,405
Alright then.

801
01:31:17,886 --> 01:31:21,805
Look into Gonca's eyes tomorrow.

802
01:31:22,286 --> 01:31:27,125
You will find the answer there
and we will act accordingly.

803
01:31:27,286 --> 01:31:30,205
Don't worry.

804
01:31:33,006 --> 01:31:36,525
Never!

805
01:31:39,086 --> 01:31:42,405
That's impossible.

806
01:31:44,206 --> 01:31:48,165
You shouldn't cut it off so fast, Olivia Hatun.

807
01:31:48,366 --> 01:31:52,485
-You think first.
-I said it's impossible, Yakup Bey.

808
01:31:53,766 --> 01:31:59,125
We heard that you were
having troubles with the trade.

809
01:31:59,606 --> 01:32:05,805
If we become relatives, we'd
like to get rid of those troubles.

810
01:32:14,446 --> 01:32:17,845
Trade, gold...

811
01:32:18,366 --> 01:32:22,765
They don't matter to me, Saadet Hatun.

812
01:32:26,006 --> 01:32:29,005
Holofira is a Christian.

813
01:32:29,566 --> 01:32:33,845
You are Muslims.

814
01:32:34,766 --> 01:32:39,085
And I will never let Holofira become a Muslim.

815
01:32:39,966 --> 01:32:46,365
We don't have such an
intention. Whatever Holofira wants.

816
01:32:47,886 --> 01:32:50,965
You say this today.

817
01:32:51,646 --> 01:32:58,045
How can I know you won't change your
mind when they get married tomorrow?

818
01:32:59,726 --> 01:33:04,365
This is not a matter of now, Olivia Hatun.

819
01:33:05,006 --> 01:33:08,925
We won't force anyone to be a Muslim.

820
01:33:10,886 --> 01:33:14,845
That's not a tiny matter that should
be left to tomorrow, Yakup Bey.

821
01:33:15,366 --> 01:33:20,525
As long as I live, Holofira
can't become a Muslim.

822
01:33:21,366 --> 01:33:25,485
She can't and she won't.

823
01:33:27,206 --> 01:33:31,685
-Right, Holofira?
-Yes.

824
01:33:34,006 --> 01:33:37,765
I don't intend to become a Muslim.

825
01:33:39,206 --> 01:33:42,445
Today or tomorrow...

826
01:33:42,806 --> 01:33:46,645
We have no intention to make Holofira Muslim.

827
01:33:46,966 --> 01:33:50,205
There are lots of Christians among our people.

828
01:33:50,286 --> 01:33:54,605
You can inquire about it. We
didn't force anyone to be a Muslim.

829
01:34:00,446 --> 01:34:04,045
Now give us an answer.

830
01:34:09,046 --> 01:34:12,285
This is an important matter.

831
01:34:12,926 --> 01:34:16,285
I will think about it, Yakup Bey.

832
01:34:17,846 --> 01:34:23,325
We'll be expecting good news from you.

833
01:34:23,806 --> 01:34:26,885
We should go now.

834
01:35:04,766 --> 01:35:08,765
Alps, are the preparations done?

835
01:35:08,846 --> 01:35:11,405
Thank Allah. Everything is set, my Bey.

836
01:35:11,486 --> 01:35:14,125
Thank you, thank you.

837
01:35:16,246 --> 01:35:20,965
Ayhan Agha... Dastard!

838
01:35:21,886 --> 01:35:24,045
He infiltrated among us.

839
01:35:24,886 --> 01:35:30,165
He caressed our beard
and put the knife on our head.

840
01:35:30,406 --> 01:35:34,885
People don't know who to trust anymore.

841
01:35:34,926 --> 01:35:40,205
They couldn't build fear in
our hearts but people are afraid.

842
01:35:41,846 --> 01:35:46,725
They attack from the shadows. So will we.

843
01:35:47,126 --> 01:35:52,645
We won't stop. Even if Ayhan
Agha goes, Vasilis will come instead.

844
01:35:52,846 --> 01:35:57,645
Even if he goes, someone will definitely come.

845
01:35:58,526 --> 01:36:04,325
They stay there. And we will always stay here.

846
01:36:05,006 --> 01:36:07,805
There will be no peace for us, huh, my Bey?

847
01:36:08,326 --> 01:36:10,965
Those who fight for Allah...

848
01:36:11,246 --> 01:36:14,845
...should leave their peace first.

849
01:36:15,166 --> 01:36:20,125
But we will never stop working
to make people have peace again.

850
01:36:20,566 --> 01:36:23,445
We will eradicate the cruel..

851
01:36:23,726 --> 01:36:28,245
...so that they won't
attempt to attack us again.

852
01:36:28,406 --> 01:36:31,603
We can do this only
with war and conquests.

853
01:36:31,615 --> 01:36:32,685
Praise be!

854
01:36:33,086 --> 01:36:34,605
Exactly!

855
01:36:34,686 --> 01:36:39,565
Alps! For this reason, continue
the preparations in the headquarters!

856
01:36:39,686 --> 01:36:43,845
As you ordered, we're both
continuing the preparations...

857
01:36:43,966 --> 01:36:46,605
...and letting everyone know about it.

858
01:36:46,886 --> 01:36:49,805
The dog must have already heard about it.

859
01:36:50,886 --> 01:36:54,125
All the preparations are also
done in Yenisehir, my Bey.

860
01:36:54,206 --> 01:36:59,285
Okay. Everybody get
back to their duties now.

861
01:37:02,326 --> 01:37:06,005
-Orhan.
-My Bey.

862
01:37:11,126 --> 01:37:16,645
If there is confusion in your
mind, don't come to the fight.

863
01:37:16,886 --> 01:37:22,605
If there is a battle, don't
hold me back, my Bey.

864
01:37:23,126 --> 01:37:27,485
The matter is in my heart, not my mind.

865
01:37:28,006 --> 01:37:32,285
And there is nothing to prevent
my desire to fight, for sure.

866
01:37:32,566 --> 01:37:35,445
Thank you, thank you.

867
01:37:54,806 --> 01:37:57,845
Come on! Come on!

868
01:38:07,446 --> 01:38:10,445
Germiyanoglu border - Frontier Market

869
01:38:21,726 --> 01:38:25,005
I sent you to Yenisehir...

870
01:38:26,406 --> 01:38:31,245
...to inform me about
Osman's every plan, Cerkutay.

871
01:38:32,406 --> 01:38:36,925
Why didn't you let me know
about Osman's raid on the caravan?

872
01:38:37,126 --> 01:38:43,285
My Sultan, they don’t trust me
or let me go among them yet.

873
01:38:43,286 --> 01:38:45,285
They will.

874
01:38:45,606 --> 01:38:51,485
You have to gain their
trust in no time, Cerkutay.

875
01:38:53,406 --> 01:38:57,605
Have you got doubts? Ha?

876
01:39:02,006 --> 01:39:07,365
Did your being in Yenisehir
relieve the fury inside you?

877
01:39:10,086 --> 01:39:14,565
They kept you away from
your son for so many years.

878
01:39:16,246 --> 01:39:19,165
For years,

879
01:39:19,366 --> 01:39:22,925
...you were a prisoner.

880
01:39:23,326 --> 01:39:26,605
Nobody looked for you.

881
01:39:27,926 --> 01:39:30,645
Did you forget that?

882
01:39:31,046 --> 01:39:33,485
I didn't.

883
01:39:34,606 --> 01:39:40,765
They left you alone. And I set you free.

884
01:39:43,526 --> 01:39:46,325
I don't want pay back, Cerkutay.

885
01:39:46,566 --> 01:39:52,925
I expect you to serve your country and nation.

886
01:39:53,006 --> 01:39:55,605
I will more than my best..

887
01:39:55,766 --> 01:39:59,325
...until the last drop of my blood, my Sultan.

888
01:39:59,486 --> 01:40:03,325
Now go to Yenisehir.

889
01:40:03,406 --> 01:40:06,205
I'll be expecting news from you.

890
01:40:06,446 --> 01:40:09,405
With your permission.

891
01:40:09,686 --> 01:40:12,845
Cerkutay.

892
01:40:22,806 --> 01:40:28,045
Although they don't trust you, I do.

893
01:40:29,966 --> 01:40:32,845
Know this.

894
01:40:33,606 --> 01:40:36,245
If you'll allow me.

895
01:40:45,566 --> 01:40:48,485
Mother.

896
01:40:49,166 --> 01:40:52,205
You called me?

897
01:40:56,046 --> 01:41:00,085
Do you have anything to say to me, Gonca?

898
01:41:01,886 --> 01:41:04,725
No, I don't.

899
01:41:19,966 --> 01:41:24,285
How many times. How many times you were..

900
01:41:24,446 --> 01:41:28,125
Lying to my face.

901
01:41:28,286 --> 01:41:31,205
I gave you a duty.

902
01:41:31,326 --> 01:41:37,045
To have Alaeddin fall for
you. And what did you do?

903
01:41:37,366 --> 01:41:41,565
You rejected the man who
confessed his love for you!

904
01:41:41,686 --> 01:41:46,005
Why? While everything was going as we wanted.

905
01:41:46,086 --> 01:41:49,205
Why did you do that, Gonca?

906
01:41:49,726 --> 01:41:52,925
How do you know of this?

907
01:41:53,446 --> 01:41:56,485
Mother, are you having me watched? To who?

908
01:41:56,566 --> 01:42:01,005
You wanted this. You lied to me, Gonca!

909
01:42:01,086 --> 01:42:03,845
Then, how do you know I lied mother!

910
01:42:03,926 --> 01:42:06,325
I know.

911
01:42:06,966 --> 01:42:09,925
You fell for Alaeddin.

912
01:42:10,526 --> 01:42:13,605
-Gonca why?
-Enough!

913
01:42:13,726 --> 01:42:16,605
Enough!

914
01:42:20,246 --> 01:42:25,325
Enough mother, enough! You do not know!

915
01:42:25,446 --> 01:42:29,205
None of you knows!

916
01:42:29,286 --> 01:42:34,965
You do not understand me.

917
01:42:42,446 --> 01:42:45,925
You left me no choice, Gonca.

918
01:42:46,446 --> 01:42:51,685
From now on, whatever I say goes.

919
01:43:14,166 --> 01:43:17,885
Inform Master Gera immediately.

920
01:43:24,046 --> 01:43:30,005
Osman. Osman crossed the line mongol!

921
01:43:30,086 --> 01:43:31,845
He thinks he is unbeatable!

922
01:43:31,966 --> 01:43:36,645
He thinks he is unbeatable as we fall back!

923
01:43:36,806 --> 01:43:42,285
The thing he doesn't know is, he will lose
Yenisehir without seeing Kite's borders.

924
01:43:42,406 --> 01:43:48,205
I will burn his Yenisehir down!

925
01:43:49,206 --> 01:43:53,045
Destroying Yenisehir is not enough.

926
01:43:53,366 --> 01:43:56,165
While you are destroying Yenisehir..

927
01:43:56,366 --> 01:44:00,005
I will attack Osman's
encampment and have his head.

928
01:44:00,086 --> 01:44:03,365
Good.

929
01:44:04,246 --> 01:44:05,765
Ayci.

930
01:44:08,246 --> 01:44:14,885
Tell soldiers to prepare. We will
strike Osman's Kite encampment.

931
01:44:18,046 --> 01:44:25,885
Alright. We will make a
heaven from the hell we'll cause.

932
01:44:26,366 --> 01:44:30,765
-We will do it together, Mongol.
-Gera...

933
01:44:36,566 --> 01:44:41,085
Osman is a cautious man. Do not forget.

934
01:44:41,206 --> 01:44:45,205
Or you will be that hell fire.

935
01:45:03,686 --> 01:45:09,765
We will place the flying fires
everywhere around Yenisehir.

936
01:45:11,086 --> 01:45:13,885
Ayhan Aga is dead.

937
01:45:14,046 --> 01:45:19,005
Today, they will meet Master Gera!

938
01:45:24,806 --> 01:45:28,285
Osman and his alps has left the city.

939
01:45:28,366 --> 01:45:30,805
Alright.

940
01:45:32,326 --> 01:45:38,005
The time has come. We are starting.

941
01:45:59,526 --> 01:46:03,125
Did they give Holofira away?

942
01:46:06,006 --> 01:46:08,565
Fatma, my angel daughter.

943
01:46:08,646 --> 01:46:11,805
From now on, you are forbidden to talk.

944
01:46:11,926 --> 01:46:15,805
What am I to do, mother?
I accidentally said it..

945
01:46:16,166 --> 01:46:18,205
After seeing my brother like that.

946
01:46:18,326 --> 01:46:21,325
Watch what you say.

947
01:46:30,526 --> 01:46:35,765
-Bala. Did you talk with Alaeddin?
-Yes?

948
01:46:37,726 --> 01:46:43,405
Fatma heard it right. Gonca
told him that she doesn't love him.

949
01:46:43,646 --> 01:46:46,365
However, Alaeddin says he doesn't believe it.

950
01:46:46,446 --> 01:46:49,525
It seems she is scared of her father.

951
01:46:49,726 --> 01:46:53,885
She doesn't look like she gets scared.

952
01:46:53,966 --> 01:46:59,605
She does not. There is something, however..

953
01:46:59,846 --> 01:47:03,445
We will learn.

954
01:47:09,126 --> 01:47:12,645
How easy it was to look after
the children when they are small.

955
01:47:12,766 --> 01:47:18,125
We thought it would get easier after they
grow up, however it is different every day.

956
01:47:18,246 --> 01:47:21,205
This is the last slope I hope.

957
01:47:21,286 --> 01:47:25,845
We will be relieved, after having them wed.

958
01:47:25,926 --> 01:47:27,725
If Allah permits.

959
01:47:28,566 --> 01:47:34,005
However, how will we give this one away?

960
01:47:34,286 --> 01:47:37,365
No. I won't give her to anyone.

961
01:47:37,486 --> 01:47:40,965
My talkative daughter will
get grow up with me here.

962
01:47:43,486 --> 01:47:47,925
Sure. I can stay with you.

963
01:47:54,926 --> 01:47:58,085
Gonca Hatun. Let me go and talk with her.

964
01:47:58,406 --> 01:48:02,445
You stay here Fatma. I'll go.

965
01:48:09,126 --> 01:48:11,205
My daughter what did I tell you?

966
01:48:11,286 --> 01:48:15,205
-Mother.
-Help me, come on.

967
01:49:07,646 --> 01:49:13,405
-I'm hungry.
-Move.

968
01:49:41,886 --> 01:49:45,005
-Gonca.
-Bala Hatun?

969
01:49:45,086 --> 01:49:50,485
My daughter. Come, let us talk.

970
01:50:05,166 --> 01:50:08,765
Alaeddin told me some things.

971
01:50:08,926 --> 01:50:12,645
I wanted to hear from you as well.

972
01:50:14,766 --> 01:50:17,885
That matter is closed, Bala Hatun.

973
01:50:18,086 --> 01:50:22,445
-There is no need to talk. If you'll allow me..
-Gonca.

974
01:50:25,966 --> 01:50:29,045
I know what love is.

975
01:50:29,846 --> 01:50:34,045
I know a woman who looks with love as well.

976
01:50:37,086 --> 01:50:41,005
I see that love in both of you.

977
01:50:41,166 --> 01:50:43,685
Your mouth denies it, however..

978
01:50:43,766 --> 01:50:46,565
No, Bala Hatun.

979
01:50:48,206 --> 01:50:51,165
That can not happen.

980
01:50:54,446 --> 01:50:58,685
If the matters between the
grown-ups is what you are scared of..

981
01:50:58,766 --> 01:51:01,645
Those are bound to get resolved.

982
01:51:01,846 --> 01:51:06,165
You tell me what you want. I will find a way.

983
01:51:07,726 --> 01:51:11,765
I do not love Alaeddin Bey.

984
01:51:16,806 --> 01:51:21,285
What did she say? She said no, right?

985
01:51:25,246 --> 01:51:28,325
Ulgen. Now you tell me.

986
01:51:28,406 --> 01:51:32,045
What is going on behind this. Tell
me what do you know about Gonca.

987
01:51:32,046 --> 01:51:35,845
I do not know. I do not know anything.

988
01:51:35,926 --> 01:51:39,845
Ulgen, tell me. I am listening.

989
01:51:48,926 --> 01:51:51,805
They are going to the passages.

990
01:51:54,886 --> 01:52:00,645
They are heading to the
passages. Hold the exits, quickly!

991
01:52:16,006 --> 01:52:19,525
Alps, this way.

992
01:52:21,726 --> 01:52:27,565
This street is never this
empty, Vasilis. Be cautious.

993
01:52:42,006 --> 01:52:44,565
We were looking for you.

994
01:52:45,086 --> 01:52:49,085
Osman Bey... You found me.

995
01:52:49,326 --> 01:52:55,445
You think you are a hunter
when you are cornered like a prey.

996
01:52:56,766 --> 01:53:01,205
But blood made you blind.
And since you see red...

997
01:53:01,366 --> 01:53:05,405
..you cannot see who is stronger than you.

998
01:53:13,086 --> 01:53:19,125
I can see, Osman. It is
your turn to see now, Osman.

999
01:53:19,486 --> 01:53:26,365
I placed flying flames in every
corner of your beautiful city.

1000
01:53:27,206 --> 01:53:32,525
You will see how this beautiful city
of yours burn and turn into ashes.

1001
01:53:32,606 --> 01:53:35,605
We caught all of your men.

1002
01:53:36,766 --> 01:53:42,165
Now it is your turn.
But first, you will answer.

1003
01:53:42,446 --> 01:53:46,525
You will tell us everything in detail.

1004
01:53:48,246 --> 01:53:51,765
I will tell you everything
I know with pleasure.

1005
01:53:52,046 --> 01:53:56,485
But this will not stop what is going to happen.

1006
01:53:56,766 --> 01:54:00,405
You and your Muslim people will...

1007
01:54:00,526 --> 01:54:02,685
...get out of these lands.

1008
01:54:02,766 --> 01:54:05,525
These lands were watered
with our martyrs' blood.

1009
01:54:05,806 --> 01:54:08,045
Then it was turned into an Islamic land.

1010
01:54:08,766 --> 01:54:15,045
We will not bow down to the cruel,
and we will not give you a piece of land.

1011
01:54:18,286 --> 01:54:22,885
Osman! I actually admire you.

1012
01:54:23,086 --> 01:54:27,245
You've made progress so
far. But it's the end of the road.

1013
01:54:27,366 --> 01:54:31,605
These lands are mine! My lands!

1014
01:54:31,686 --> 01:54:35,165
You will give me what is mine, Osman!

1015
01:54:35,246 --> 01:54:37,845
-Come at me now.
-Attack!

1016
01:54:37,966 --> 01:54:40,725
Do not die before you kill them!

1017
01:54:54,606 --> 01:54:56,605
The war is just beginning, Osman.

1018
01:54:56,726 --> 01:54:59,325
The war is just beginning.
We will not step back!

1019
01:54:59,566 --> 01:55:03,125
I will kill you all one by
one today. But first, you!

1020
01:55:03,366 --> 01:55:08,125
You always attacked us like a
shadow. Now come at me like a man!

1021
01:55:08,206 --> 01:55:12,685
We never let the cruel win!

1022
01:56:05,246 --> 01:56:10,125
Orhan! Go to the frontiers marketplace!

1023
01:56:10,206 --> 01:56:13,685
Provide security there, my
son. I will bring this dog there.

1024
01:56:13,766 --> 01:56:16,565
Yes my Bey.

1025
01:56:18,646 --> 01:56:22,325
Take this! Come on!

1026
01:56:34,126 --> 01:56:38,445
-What are we waiting for, Commander?
-Wait.

1027
01:57:16,246 --> 01:57:21,405
-Trap...
-Trap, right.

1028
01:57:21,726 --> 01:57:26,325
You will hit me with my own weapon, huh, Osman?

1029
01:57:26,406 --> 01:57:29,285
Dirty man..

1030
01:57:31,566 --> 01:57:36,205
He is protecting his headquarters
with traps, he knew we would come.

1031
01:57:36,366 --> 01:57:39,266
He must've known about Gera as well,
since he knew about us.

1032
01:57:39,266 --> 01:57:41,116
The Crusader was lured into a trap.

1033
01:57:41,126 --> 01:57:43,805
What are we going to do, Commander?

1034
01:57:43,886 --> 01:57:47,405
We will attack him from his weakest spot.

1035
01:57:47,486 --> 01:57:51,445
We are leaving. Come on, my soldiers.

1036
01:58:03,566 --> 01:58:07,125
-What did you think would happen, huh?
-Osman...

1037
01:58:07,806 --> 01:58:11,125
I was just starting to like you.

1038
01:58:15,366 --> 01:58:18,245
Vasilis! Thomas! Run!

1039
01:58:18,686 --> 01:58:21,485
-Master!
-Run away!

1040
01:58:21,606 --> 01:58:25,125
-Master!
-You will come back for revenge.

1041
01:58:25,246 --> 01:58:30,165
You will make the Crusade stronger.

1042
01:58:36,366 --> 01:58:39,805
Stand up! Stand up!

1043
01:58:51,326 --> 01:58:55,285
My Bey. This dog's cubs ran away my Bey.

1044
01:58:55,366 --> 01:58:57,485
We have the head of the snake.

1045
01:58:58,686 --> 01:59:02,605
Let its tail run away. Let it run away.

1046
01:59:02,766 --> 01:59:07,365
Come on. Bring him. We are
going to the frontiers marketplace.

1047
01:59:07,846 --> 01:59:11,885
-Come on!
-Come on! Walk!

1048
01:59:11,966 --> 01:59:15,565
Come on! Walk!

1049
01:59:17,086 --> 01:59:20,085
Germiyanoglu Border - Frontier Market

1050
01:59:25,286 --> 01:59:27,525
Holofira did not come.

1051
01:59:27,606 --> 01:59:30,205
Look... You are curious about her.

1052
01:59:30,326 --> 01:59:32,805
How are we going to learn
what she said, mother?

1053
01:59:32,926 --> 01:59:37,125
My daughter... Didn't you hear your brother?
She did not accept becoming a Muslim.

1054
01:59:37,686 --> 01:59:40,165
Do not talk about this subject again.

1055
01:59:42,966 --> 01:59:45,485
What happened, Malhun Hatun?

1056
01:59:45,726 --> 01:59:48,925
Why are you looking at Holofira's counter?

1057
01:59:49,046 --> 01:59:52,445
What happened Saadet Hatun?
Were you watching us?

1058
01:59:52,606 --> 01:59:57,965
No... I was looking at
my bride-to-be's counter...

1059
01:59:58,366 --> 02:00:01,925
And I saw you.

1060
02:00:03,766 --> 02:00:06,845
Did Holofira accept getting married?

1061
02:00:06,926 --> 02:00:12,805
Right. Holofira is now my daughter-in-law.

1062
02:00:16,126 --> 02:00:19,525
I don't want to see Orhan at my marketplace.

1063
02:00:20,246 --> 02:00:22,045
Keep your son away.

1064
02:00:22,206 --> 02:00:25,645
Who are you to decide
where my son goes or leaves?

1065
02:00:25,926 --> 02:00:31,845
Malhun... I am the owner
of this frontiers marketplace.

1066
02:00:33,726 --> 02:00:37,685
And I am Holofira’s mother-in-law.

1067
02:00:39,006 --> 02:00:44,165
What? Whose mother-in-law are you?

1068
02:00:46,526 --> 02:00:49,085
What are you saying, Saadet Hatun?

1069
02:00:49,166 --> 02:00:54,645
You heard it, Orhan Bey.
Holofira is my daughter-in-law now.

1070
02:00:55,526 --> 02:00:58,365
I don't want to see you around her now.

1071
02:00:58,606 --> 02:01:01,885
Orhan!

1072
02:01:12,446 --> 02:01:17,205
-Orhan?
-You... you...

1073
02:01:17,486 --> 02:01:21,525
How could you do this to me Holofira?

1074
02:01:21,846 --> 02:01:25,245
Orhan.. What happened? I don't understand.

1075
02:01:26,886 --> 02:01:30,685
I could never know you
would do this, Lord's daughter.

1076
02:01:34,046 --> 02:01:37,285
Never.

1077
02:01:41,646 --> 02:01:46,525
They moved away from our arrow, but...

1078
02:01:46,686 --> 02:01:49,605
...my brother's revenge will be taken!

1079
02:01:58,286 --> 02:02:03,245
Get ready to burn and destroy!

1080
02:02:05,686 --> 02:02:10,845
My soldiers! We came and we saw!

1081
02:02:11,246 --> 02:02:16,045
Now it is time to destroy them!

1082
02:02:21,006 --> 02:02:25,485
You will be settled in every corner of the
market. Everyone will keep their eyes open.

1083
02:02:25,566 --> 02:02:30,045
We will see what the
situation is in the marketplace.

1084
02:02:30,246 --> 02:02:33,405
Yes my Shahzade.

1085
02:02:46,566 --> 02:02:51,805
The great people of my lands, welcome.

1086
02:03:09,966 --> 02:03:12,925
Yakup.

1087
02:03:14,166 --> 02:03:17,605
Yakup...

1088
02:03:21,846 --> 02:03:28,725
This doesn't suit you, Yakup Bey.

1089
02:03:47,806 --> 02:03:51,965
How could you do this.

1090
02:03:52,206 --> 02:03:58,365
You did such a terrible thing
just to take me behind you, Yakup?

1091
02:04:04,206 --> 02:04:07,885
It doesn't suit you, Yakup Bey.

1092
02:04:08,206 --> 02:04:12,485
What you did doesn't suit you at all.

1093
02:04:12,766 --> 02:04:17,525
Maybe he did what suits him, right?

1094
02:04:17,606 --> 02:04:19,685
Enough!

1095
02:04:26,686 --> 02:04:30,365
You forced me into it.

1096
02:04:33,366 --> 02:04:37,165
I said I don't like confusion.

1097
02:04:39,486 --> 02:04:44,245
I said if someone's mind is confused,
he shouldn't keep his mind over his body.

1098
02:04:44,966 --> 02:04:48,605
You didn't get it.

1099
02:04:50,926 --> 02:04:55,645
We didn't take these lands just to lose them

1100
02:04:55,846 --> 02:04:58,925
because of someone's dreams.

1101
02:04:59,686 --> 02:05:02,725
I will not let you

1102
02:05:02,886 --> 02:05:07,365
ruin these lands because of that dreams.

1103
02:05:19,206 --> 02:05:23,485
You will walk in my path.

1104
02:05:24,166 --> 02:05:27,325
I'll give you Alps.

1105
02:05:27,806 --> 02:05:30,805
I'll give you power.

1106
02:05:33,126 --> 02:05:36,485
Under my command,

1107
02:05:36,566 --> 02:05:42,565
we will conquer both east and west.

1108
02:05:49,006 --> 02:05:52,765
Osman Bey is coming.

1109
02:05:59,726 --> 02:06:05,085
Did you invite Osman Bey too?

1110
02:06:19,206 --> 02:06:22,725
I called someone else,

1111
02:06:23,206 --> 02:06:29,165
but he is coming before us. Come, Osman.

1112
02:06:31,286 --> 02:06:34,245
Selamun Aleykum.

1113
02:06:35,766 --> 02:06:40,565
-What is he doing here?
-We'll find it out, Hatun.

1114
02:06:40,726 --> 02:06:44,125
We will find it out.

1115
02:06:47,606 --> 02:06:53,565
Yakup Sultan. Once again,

1116
02:06:53,846 --> 02:07:00,885
we did what you needed to do.
You have only fallen into a trap.

1117
02:07:01,006 --> 02:07:06,285
What nonsense are you talking about, Osman Bey?

1118
02:07:06,526 --> 02:07:11,245
If you have something
to say, say it. If not, leave.

1119
02:07:11,646 --> 02:07:15,325
I have something to tell you.

1120
02:07:16,286 --> 02:07:19,325
I also have things to say to people.

1121
02:07:21,406 --> 02:07:26,405
Alps. Bring him.

1122
02:07:38,766 --> 02:07:41,765
Who is he?

1123
02:07:52,286 --> 02:07:59,245
One of the heads of the snake.
One of those who trapped you

1124
02:08:00,086 --> 02:08:06,485
and tricked you. Yakup Bey.

1125
02:08:10,446 --> 02:08:17,445
One of those who sat
in our table and killed us.

1126
02:08:35,526 --> 02:08:39,285
You know him as merchant Ayhan Agha.

1127
02:08:39,486 --> 02:08:45,645
His real name is Gera. One
of the leaders of Crusaders.

1128
02:08:47,246 --> 02:08:50,605
You dastard!

1129
02:08:58,246 --> 02:09:03,285
Did you have other dreams?

1130
02:09:06,286 --> 02:09:09,885
The dream is not mine, Osman.

1131
02:09:11,086 --> 02:09:15,445
It is the dream of those who believe in Jesus.

1132
02:09:25,526 --> 02:09:29,125
You will all die.

1133
02:09:31,006 --> 02:09:37,445
You will all die and be buried
under these sacred lands.

1134
02:09:37,566 --> 02:09:40,125
You will all die, Osman.

1135
02:09:40,366 --> 02:09:43,045
Look.

1136
02:09:45,166 --> 02:09:48,605
Look at me.

1137
02:09:55,486 --> 02:10:00,605
We will always prevail as you
keep saying "you will be destroyed."

1138
02:10:00,726 --> 02:10:05,565
Come here. Look at me.

1139
02:10:05,766 --> 02:10:12,485
We will always stand upright
as long as you try to ruin us.

1140
02:10:14,046 --> 02:10:17,765
Get up! Get up!

1141
02:10:23,766 --> 02:10:30,685
You oppress your own people, as if it's
not enough, you oppress my people too.

1142
02:10:30,926 --> 02:10:41,045
Look at me. I'm the one who
destroys the cruel ones, Gera.

1143
02:10:44,806 --> 02:10:49,325
You might fool other people with what you say

1144
02:10:50,446 --> 02:10:54,445
but you can't fool me.

1145
02:10:55,006 --> 02:10:59,205
You will be ruined.

1146
02:11:08,446 --> 02:11:13,245
Look at me. Look at me.

1147
02:11:13,806 --> 02:11:16,845
Lift your head.

1148
02:11:17,686 --> 02:11:23,845
These innocent people you see will be
the ones who will take revenge on infidels.

1149
02:11:25,846 --> 02:11:31,285
Haven't you heard about it?
Haven't you heard about it?

1150
02:11:34,206 --> 02:11:38,965
They say "be afraid of the
anger of innocent ones."

1151
02:11:39,046 --> 02:11:42,525
Nobody told you about this?

1152
02:11:48,486 --> 02:11:52,605
They did, Osman.

1153
02:11:54,006 --> 02:11:56,365
Let your people

1154
02:11:57,486 --> 02:12:03,445
hear the last words of the
man who will lose his head.

1155
02:12:09,406 --> 02:12:16,125
Your Osman Bey wants to establish a state

1156
02:12:16,686 --> 02:12:20,805
that will stand tall as himself.

1157
02:12:21,446 --> 02:12:26,765
He will never be able to establish
that state, if you follow him,

1158
02:12:26,886 --> 02:12:32,805
you will all die. Even without us, Mongols,

1159
02:12:32,926 --> 02:12:39,565
Mongols will kill you
all. These lands are ours!

1160
02:12:39,646 --> 02:12:45,925
These lands are ours, Osman!

1161
02:13:21,886 --> 02:13:26,925
We will resist against the oppressors

1162
02:13:27,006 --> 02:13:32,965
and we will always prevail
under the banner of Islam.

1163
02:13:33,606 --> 02:13:37,885
We will prevail even if there
are those who are afraid.

1164
02:13:38,046 --> 02:13:41,845
We will rise even if there
are those who run away.

1165
02:13:46,926 --> 02:13:52,005
With the permission of
Allah we will always prevail.

1166
02:13:52,206 --> 02:14:09,405
-Allah is the greatest
-Allah is the greatest

1167
02:14:18,428 --> 02:14:29,008
Visit turkision.com for more!